<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Matumbi Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">YOANI</para>
  <para style="toc1">Injili ya Yoani</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yoani</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yoa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yoani</para>
  <para style="mt2">Injili ya Yesu Mwaiandikilwe na Yoani</para>
  <para style="imt">Kilongolyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Injili kati mwaiandikilwe na Yoani, itubakia panga Yesu nga Liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu' yu'lu' ywaaisi padunia no ba mundu, aatami kwitu (1:14). Kati mwakitubakia kitabu sene, Injili yi' yaandikilwe li'nga asomi bake bapate u'bi'lya panga Yesu nga Nkosopoli, Mwana wa Nnu'ngu', na kwa kunnemya ywembe, yani kumwu'bi'lya, bandu bapata bwu'mi (20:31).</para>
  <para style="ip">Pano tupeyelwa wi'ti' kilongolyo sakitulaya mpu'la panga Yesu nga Liyi'gi'yo lya Nnu'ngu', no bakiyilwa bu'kana na mangelongelo nsi'si' gagali'nga laya panga, Yesu nga Nkosopoli ywaabakiyilwe na Nnu'ngu' atumilwe padunia, ywembe nga Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'. Tubakiyilwa mu'lu' bandu bi'ngi' mwabamwu'bi'li Yesu no panga apwasi bake, popo bi'ngi' kabantaukya no kana kumwu'bi'lya.</para>
  <para style="ip">Sula ya 13-17 ilaya mpu'la lu'mbana kwa kisake kati ya Yesu na apwasi bake, na kutupeya mayi'gi'yo gake ga kutusenga na kutuyi'ya mwoyo kubile balo bambilwa kwake. Milyango ya nnu'ngi' ibaya bu'kana no boyolwa kwa Yesu, ukumilwa, bambilwa, yu'ka na kwapitya apwasi bake bu'ka pa uyu'ki wake.</para>
  <para style="ip">Injili ya Yoani ikong'ondelya likowe lya ukoto wangayomoka, waupatikana kwa ndi'la ya Yesu Kilisitu. Ukoto wo wangayomoka, nga upo kwa balu' babannyi'ki'tya Kilisitu Yesu ywembe nga ndi'la, ukakape na bwu'mi witu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kwa ndi'la ya kisake, Yoani atuawanikia makowe ga ngama mumaisa ga Yesu, kwo tumya makowe gagapangika mumaisa ga kila lisu'ba, li'nga awanikia maisa ga loo kati, masi', kilyo, bweya, nsungi, nni'mi, na gi'ngi'.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu'no nga nnu'ndu'ngo wa itabu ya Injili yaiyendelya andikilwa li'nga kukuyangatia Wammatu'mbi' waupendilwe. Tukulu'bya uyendeli kwisoma itabu yi'no li'nga upate yaliwa kati mwabini Nnu'ngu' kwo pi'tya lina lya Mwana wake ywampendile Yesu Kilisitu, ywaayi'ki'ti waa munsalaba kwa kitumbu sa masambi ga bandu boti. Ywembe ampenda kila mundu ywannyi'ki'tya na kumwu'bi'lya.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1" />
  <para style="s">Liyi'gi'yo ngalipanga mundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1" />Kwai'mbu' kwai na Liyi'gi'yo, aywo Liyi'gi'yo aai na Nnu'ngu', naywembe aai Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2" />Bu'ka kwai'mbu', aywo Liyi'gi'yo aai pamope na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3" />Kwo pi'tya ywembe ili'be yoti ngaiumbilwe, na pangali ywembe ntu'pu' kili'be sakiumbilwe. <verse eid="JHN 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4" />Nkati yake ngamwawabile ukoto, na ukoto wo ngawaletike bweya kwa bandu. <verse eid="JHN 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5" />Bweya wo umulika mulubi'ndu', na lubi'ndu' lukombwili kuuimiya.<verse eid="JHN 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6" />Aaisi mundu yumo ywaatumilwe bu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu', lina lyake Yoani. <verse eid="JHN 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7" />Aywo aaisi kong'ondelya bu'kana na bweya wo, kwo pi'tya ywembe bandu boti bauu'bi'li. <verse eid="JHN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8" />Ywembe aabileli wu'lu' bweya we, ila aaisi kwabakia bandu bu'kana na awo bweya. <verse eid="JHN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9" />Wu'lu' bweya wa kakape, uisa padunia, wammulikya kila mundu.<verse eid="JHN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10" />Liyi'gi'yo aabile padunia na kwa ndi'la yake dunia ngaiumbilwe, lakini dunia yantangiteli. <verse eid="JHN 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11" />Aaisi kasake, lakini babaabile bandu bake baampokili. <verse eid="JHN 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12" />Lakini boti babampokile, aapei uweso wo pangika bana ba Nnu'ngu', nga balu' babaliu'bi'lya lina lyake, <verse eid="JHN 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13" />baabelekwili kwa myai, wala kati mwaipala yi'ga au mundu, ila mwapendi Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="JHN 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14" />Nalyembe Liyi'gi'yo lyapangike mundu no tama pamope na twenga. Na twenga twaubweni utukupu wake, utukupu wu'lu' waapeyilwe Mwana wa kisake ywabu'ka kwa Tati'. Ywembe aalayite ukakape woti na ngu'ngu' ngu'lu' ya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="JHN 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15" />Yoani aau'bwiye lilobe kaabakia bandu makowe gake, kabaya, “Ayu' nga yu'lu' ywanammakiye panga, ‘Ywembe ywalu'a isa pasu'gu' yangu', nga nku'lu' kulikoni nenga, kwa mwanjaa nenga nabelekwali, ywembe aabile.’”<verse eid="JHN 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16" />Kwo bu'kana no timilika kwake, twenga twaboti tupoki ngu'ngu' ngu'lu' yatwi'li'yilwe nayo. <verse eid="JHN 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17" />Kwa mwanjaa salya ya Nnu'ngu' yaaletilwe kwa luboko lwa Musa, nambi'yambi' ngu'ngu' na kakape yaaisi kwa luboko lwa Yesu Kilisitu. <verse eid="JHN 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18" />Ntu'pu' mundu ywoywoti ywaamweni Nnu'ngu' katu, ila Mwana wa kisake ywabile nsawani na Nnu'ngu', ywembe ywalu'mbine na Tati', ngaywatubakiye makowe ga Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="JHN 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukong'ondeli wa Yoani Ywabatisage</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat 3:1-12</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mal 1:1-8</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19" />Amo, ngamwaalongei Yoani api'ndo ba Ayahudi pabaatumike alongosi ba dini na Alawi bu'ka ku Yelusalemu kunnaluya, “Wenga wa nyai?” <verse eid="JHN 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20" />Yoani aakanili yangwa pabannalwiye, aalongei mpu'la kabaya, “Nenga na Kilisitu lili.” <verse eid="JHN 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21" />Ngabannaluya, “Wenga wanyai nde? Wenga wa Elia?” Ywembe ngaayangwa, “Lili, nenga na Elia lili.” “Wenga wa yu'lu' Nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu'?” Ngaayangwa, “Lili.” <verse eid="JHN 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22" />Ngababaya, “Bai utubakiye panga wenga wa nyai, li'nga tupate sakwabakia babatutumike. Wenga wamwene wikema wanyai?” <verse eid="JHN 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23" />Yoani ngayangwa, “Nenga nga na <char style="qt">li'lu' lilobe lya mundu ywakema kulupu'ngu'ti', ‘Mugolwe ndi'la ya Bwana,’</char> ywaabaite Nnondoli Isaya.”<verse eid="JHN 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24" />Bandu bo baatumilwe na Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25" />Ngabannaluya, “Manaitei wenga wa Kilisitu li, kai' wa Elia li, na wayu'lu' Nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' li, mboni wendabatisa?” <verse eid="JHN 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26" />Yoani ngaayangwa, “Nenga nibatisa kwa masi', lakini pakatikati yinu ayi'mi mundu ywamumwomongwa. <verse eid="JHN 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27" /><figure style="fig" file="05 Sandals.jpg" size="col" copy="All pictures are owned by PBT and Jonathan McDaniel and are licensed with the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported License." ref="1:27">Lugoi lwa ilatu</figure>Aywo ywaisa pasu'gu' yangu', nenga nipwaikali ata undwana lugoi lwa ilatu yake.”<verse eid="JHN 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28" />Makowe aga goti gaapangike ku Betania, kwiyi' ya Libi'ndi' lya Yordani, pandu paabile Yoani kabatisa.<verse eid="JHN 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Mwana Ngondolo wa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29" />Pammalau' yake, Yoani aamweni Yesu kaisa paabile, ngabaya, “Ayu' nga Mwana Ngondolo wa Nnu'ngu' ywagabu'ya masambi ga dunia! <verse eid="JHN 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30" />Ayu' nga yu'lu' ywanaalongei makowe gake panga, ‘Aisa mundu nku'lu' nsu'gu' yangu' kulikoni nenga, kwa mwanjaa nenga nabelekwali, ywembe aabile!’ <verse eid="JHN 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31" />Nenga namwene nantangiteli, lakini kitumbu so isa batisa kwa masi' saai, bandu ba Isilaili bapate kuntanga.”<verse eid="JHN 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32" />Kai' Yoani aakong'ondeli kabaya, “Nimmweni Loo kauluka bu'ka kunani kati ngunda, no tu'la panani yake. <verse eid="JHN 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33" />Nenga nantangiteli, lakini yu'lu' ywanitumike nibatise kwa masi' aanibakiye, ‘Yu'lu' ywawammona Loo kamuulukya no tama panani yake, aywo nga ywaalu'a batisa kwa Loo Mpeleteu.’ <verse eid="JHN 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34" />Nenga namwene nilibweni likowe li', nganikong'ondelya panga ayu' nga Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="JHN 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banamasi' alongoi ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35" />Pammalau' yake, Yoani na banamasi' bake abi'li' baabile pandu po kai'. <verse eid="JHN 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36" />Paamweni Yesu kapi'ta, ngabaya, “Lingulya, Ayu' nga Mwana Ngondolo wa Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="JHN 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37" />Balu' banamasi' abi'li' pabannyuwine Yoani kalongela go, ngabanki'ngama Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38" />Yesu aatigalambuka ngaabona abo banamasi' kabammi'ngi'ya, aatikwalaluya, “Mupala namani?” Baatikunnyangwa, “Rabi,” (lombolya Mwalimu), “Utama kwaku'?” <verse eid="JHN 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Mwisange, mulu'a pabona.” Kwa nyo ngabayenda na kupabona pandu patamage, baatami nakwe lisu'ba li'lu', mpaka musaa ku'mi kitamwiyo.<verse eid="JHN 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40" />Andelea nnunawe Simoni Petili, aabile yumo ywa banamasi' abi'li' babaayu'wine galu' gaagalongei Yoani, nabembe ngabammi'ngi'ya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41" />Andelea aankoli wi'ti' nku'we Simoni na kummakia, “Tunkoli Masiya (lombolya Kilisitu)!” <verse eid="JHN 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42" />Nembe ngampeleka Simoni kwa Yesu. Yesu aatikunninga no baya, “Wenga wa Simoni, mwana wa Yoani, nambi'yambi' ulu'a kemelwa wa Kefa.” (Lilombolya Petili au Liwe).</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 1:42">Kemelwa kwa Pilipi nanyine Natanaeli</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 1:42">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Philip calling Nathanael - CN01664" file="PhilipCallingNathanael_John1.45_CN01664.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="1:42" /> <verse eid="JHN 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43" />Pammalau' yake Yesu apalage yenda Galilaya, bai ngankwemba Pilipi, ngammakia, “Unibi'ngi'ye.” <verse eid="JHN 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44" />Pilipi aai mwenekaya wa Betisaida, kukilambo sa ki Andelea na Petili. <verse eid="JHN 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45" />Pilipi nembe ngankwemba Natanaeli na kummakia, “Tunkoli yu'lu' ywembe makowe gake gaandikilwe mukitabu sa salya ya Musa na alondoli ba Nnu'ngu', yani Yesu mwana wa Yusupu bu'ka Nasaleti.” <verse eid="JHN 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46" />Natanaeli ngannaluya Pilipi, “Nasaleti! Buli, kikowe kinannoga kiwesa pitya bu'ka ku Nasaleti?” Pilipi ngammakia, “Wise saulole.” <verse eid="JHN 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47" />Yesu pamweni Natanaeli kamwisilya, aalongei makowe gake kabaya, “Lingulya, ayu' kakape Mwisilaili. Nkati yake ntu'pu' kipi'li'.” <verse eid="JHN 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48" />Natanaeli ngannaluya, “Unitangite buli?” Yesu ngannyangwa, “Naakubweni pawaabile pai' ya ntini, Pilipi abile balo kukukema.” <verse eid="JHN 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49" />Natanaeli ngammakia kai', “Mwalimu, wenga wa Mwana wa Nnu'ngu' na wa Nkulungwa wa Isilaili!” <verse eid="JHN 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50" />Yesu ngammakia, “Uu'bi'lya mwanjaa naakubakiye naakubweni pawaabile pai' ya ntini? Bai, wagabona makowe maku'lu' kulikoni go.” <verse eid="JHN 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51" />Apo ngaabakia, “Kakape gano ganimmakia mwenga, mwakubona kunani kakuyu'gu'ka na malaika ba Nnu'ngu' kabau'bu'ka no uluka bu'ka kunani mpaka kwa Mwana wa Mundu.”<verse eid="JHN 1:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2" />
  <para style="s">Lisengele lya kukilambo sa Kana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1" />Lisu'ba lyenetatu kwai na lisengele kukilambo sa Kana ya Galilaya, na mau' bake Yesu baabile kwo. <verse eid="JHN 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2" />Yesu na banamasi' bake nabembe baakokilwe kulisengele lyo. <verse eid="JHN 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3" />Divai payaayomwike, mau' bake ngabammakia Yesu, “Divai iyomwike.” <verse eid="JHN 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4" />Yesu ngaabakia mau' bake, “Mau', lyanipalikwa panga nilitangite, ila saa yo panga lyengo lyangu' inaikali.” <verse eid="JHN 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5" />Mau' bake Yesu ngaabakia balu' apangakasi ba lisengele, “Lyolyoti lyaalu'a kummakia, mwapange.” <figure style="fig" alt="Water into wine - WA03814" file="WaterIntoWine(WeddingInCana)_John2.1-12_WA03814.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="2:5" /><verse eid="JHN 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6" />Bai, palu' kwaabile na ibi'ga sita yaiukulilwe kwa maliwe. Kwa mimu ya Kiyahudi, ibi'ga yo baitumyage kwa kwipeletea, kila kibi'ga kiwesage twi'lya malebe matano. <verse eid="JHN 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7" />Yesu ngaabakia balu' atumisi, “Mwiitwi'li'ye masi' ayo ibi'ga.” Nabembe ngabaitwi'li'ya yi'lu' ibi'ga genugenu. <verse eid="JHN 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8" />Bu'kapo ngaabakia, “Nambi'yambi' muteke ago masi' masini, mumpeleki mpi'ndo wa si'li'ku'si'li'ku'.” Kwa nyo ngabateka na kumpelekya. <verse eid="JHN 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9" />Yu'lu' mpi'ndo wa si'li'ku'si'li'ku' paagapayite masi' go, kumbe gaagalambwike panga divai. Ywembe aatangiteli kwaibu'i, lakini balu' atumisi babaatekite masi' baatangite. Mpi'ndo wa si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ngaankema mwene lisengele, <verse eid="JHN 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10" />ngammakia, “Kila mundu atumbwa wi'ti' bi'ka wiso divai inannoga, ata balu' babakokilwe pabaabonekana bayukwite, bapiya yi'lu' yanganoga. Lakini wenga wibi'i divai inannoga muno kulikoni ya patumbu!”<verse eid="JHN 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11" />Yesu aapangite mwasu wu'no nnongoi, akwo Kana ya Galilaya. Aalayite utukupu wake, na banamasi' bake ngabamwu'bi'lya.<verse eid="JHN 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12" />Bu'kapo, Yesu aaeli pamope na mau' bake, anunabe, na banamasi' bake, baalumuli ku Kapernaumu, akwo baatami kwa masu'ba masini.<verse eid="JHN 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu Munyumba ya Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-13">Mat 21:12-13</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:15-17">Mal 11:15-17</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:45-46">Luk 19:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13" />Paliegeli lisu'ba lya si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Pasika ya Ayahudi, Yesu aatiu'bu'ka yenda ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14" /><figure style="fig" alt="People exchanging money" file="NT-10 Money Changer.tif" size="col" ref="2:14">Bandu bapunja mbanje</figure>Akwo kulua lwa nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', aakoli bandu kabapi'mi'ya ng'ombe, ngondolo, na ngunda. Na balu' babapunja mbanje baabile batami mumesa. <verse eid="JHN 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15" />Aapotike nkwasu wa lukamba, ngaabi'nga boti bu'ka pandu paluwa lwa nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', pamope na ngondolo na ng'ombe. Aapi'li'ngwi mesa ya balu' babaabile kabapunja mbanje na kwiyitana mbanje yabe. <verse eid="JHN 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16" />Ngaabakia balu' babaabile kabasulusa ngunda, “Ikowe yi' mubu'ye pano! Nyumba ya Tati' bangu' kanemwiyu'ye pandu po sulusilya!” <verse eid="JHN 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17" />Banamasi' bake ngabaku'mbu'kya panga iandikilwe, <char style="qt">“Bwigu wangu' kwa nyumba yako wendanilangamisa.”</char><verse eid="JHN 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18" />Apo Ayahudi ngabannaluya Yesu, “Uwesa kutulaya mwasu waku', li'nga tutange uku'lu' waubile nawo wo panga makowe ga?” <verse eid="JHN 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Mwibomwane nyumba yi' ya Nnu'ngu', nanenga nilu'a kwisenga kai' kwa masu'ba gatatu!” <verse eid="JHN 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20" />Apo Ayahudi ngababaya, “Nyumba yi' ya Nnu'ngu' yaasengilwe kwa myaka alubaini na sita, na wenga ubaya ulu'a kwisenga kwa masu'ba gatatu?”<verse eid="JHN 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21" />Lakini ywembe nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' yailongelile yai yi'ga yake. <verse eid="JHN 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22" />Paayu'kite bu'ka kuuwi'li, banamasi' bake ngabaku'mbu'kya galu' gaabaite. Ngabagau'bi'lya Maandiko Mapeleteu na makowe galu' gaabaite Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aitangite myoyo ya bandu boti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23" />Yesu paabile kusi'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Pasika akwo ku Yelusalemu, bandu baingi baaibweni myasu ya ayabu yaipangage, ngabamwu'bi'lya. <verse eid="JHN 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24" />Lakini mwanjaa Yesu aatangite bandu boti, aau'bi'lili. <verse eid="JHN 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25" />Aapalikeli bakiyilwa na mundu kikowe sosoti kwa makowe ga bandu, kwa mwanjaa aagatangite wisowiso makowe goti gagabile mumyoyo ya bandu.<verse eid="JHN 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alongela na Nikodemo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus with Nicodemus - CN01670" file="JesusWithNicodemus_John3.1-2_CN01670.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="3:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1" />Kwaabile na mundu yumo Mfalisayo, lina lyake Nikodemo, kolongosi yumo mu Balasa Liku'lu' lya Ayahudi lyalitawalage lya Ayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2" />Ywembe aamwisili Yesu kilo ngammakia, “Mwalimu, tutangite panga wenga wa mwalimu wotumilwe na Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa ntu'pu' mundu ywakombwa panga myasu yawipanga wenga ila Nnu'ngu' abe pamope nakwe.”<verse eid="JHN 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3" />Yesu ngammakia, “Kakape nikubakia, mundu mana akotwike belekwa mala yenebi'li', aakombwali yingya mu Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="JHN 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4" />Nikodemo ngannaluya, “Mundu ywakomile awesabuli belekwa kai'? Awesa yingya mundumbo ya mau' bake no belekwa pampanda pabi'li'?” <verse eid="JHN 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5" />Yesu ngammakia, “Kakape nikubakia, mundu mana akotwike belekwa kwa masi' na Loo, awesali katu yingya mu Ukulungwa wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6" />Sakibelekwa na mundu sa yi'ga, sakibelekwa na Loo, sa Loo. <verse eid="JHN 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7" />Kwa nyo, kaneuomongwe panikubakia, ‘Mupalikwa belekwa pampanda pabi'li'.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8" />Nsunga upukatya yenda kwaupala, pukatya kwake wendakuuyu'wa, lakini utangiteli kwaubu'ka wala kwauyenda. Nyinyonyo kati mwaibile mundu mwabelekwa kwa Loo.”<verse eid="JHN 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9" />Nikodemo ngannaluya, “Makowe ga gapangika buli?” <verse eid="JHN 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Wenga wa mwalimu wotanganikwe kwa Baisilaili, ugatangiteli makowe ga? <verse eid="JHN 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11" />Nikubakia kakape, twenga tulongela gatugatangite no kong'onndelya gatugabweni, lakini mwenga mugakana gatummakia. <verse eid="JHN 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12" />Manaitei kamukana u'bi'lya panimmakianga makowe ga padunia, mwaniu'bi'lya buli panammakianga makowe ga kunani? <verse eid="JHN 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13" />Ntu'pu' mundu ywau'bwike yenda kunani ila Mwana wa Mundu, ywembe ngaywaulwike bu'ka kunani. <figure style="fig" alt="Bronze snake and Moses" file="cn01671c.TIF" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="3:13" /><verse eid="JHN 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14" />“Kati mu'lu' Musa mwantu'ndu'biye nng'ambo wa kyu'ma kunani ku'lu' kulupu'ngu'ti', nembe Mwana wa Mundu apalikwa tu'ndu'bi'yi'lwa kunani nyinyonyo, <verse eid="JHN 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15" />li'nga kila mundu ywamwu'bi'lya abe na ukoto wangayomoka. <verse eid="JHN 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16" />Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' aaipendi dunia, ngampiya mwana wake wa kisake, li'nga kila mundu ywamwu'bi'lya aakaneoba, ila abe na ukoto wangayomoka. <verse eid="JHN 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17" />Kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' antumiteli Mwana wake isa kwisenwa dunia, ila dunia ikosopolelwe na Ywembe.<verse eid="JHN 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18" />“Ywamwu'bi'lya Mwana aasenulwali, ywakana kumwu'bi'lya ayomwike senulwa kwa mwanjaa amwu'bi'lili Mwana wa kisake wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19" />No senulwa kwene nga ku'no, panga bweya wisi padunia lakini bandu balupendi lubi'ndu' kulikoni bweya, kwa mwanjaa makowe gabapanga maakau. <verse eid="JHN 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20" />Kwa mwanjaa kila ywapanga maakau ausukwa bweya na aisali kubweya li'nga makowe gake maakau gaakane bonekana. <verse eid="JHN 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21" />Lakini yu'lu' ywapanga makowe ga kakape, aisa kubweya li'nga gaagapanga gabonekane mpu'la panga gapangilwe mwapala Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="JHN 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yoani Ywabatisage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22" />Bu'ka pa go, Yesu na banamasi' bake baayi'i kunni'ma wa Yudea. Aatami kwo pamope nabo kwa masu'ba kaabatisa bandu. <verse eid="JHN 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23" />Yoani nembe aabile kabatisa akwo Ainoni, papipi na Salimu, kwa mwanjaa akwo kwai na masi' gatwi'la. Bandu baatikunnyendelya li'nga aabatise. <verse eid="JHN 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24" />Nsimu wo Yoani aabile balo anayingiyilwali muutabilwe.<verse eid="JHN 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25" />Kwaapitike ntau mukipi'nga sa banamasi' ba Yoani na Nnyahudi yumo bu'kana na mimu ya kwipeletea kwo uluga. <verse eid="JHN 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26" />Bai, banamasi' bo ngabannyendelya Yoani na kummakia, “Mwalimu, yu'lu' mundu ywawaabile nakwe kwiyi' ya Yordani, na ngaywawankong'ondeli makowe gake, nambi'yambi' naywembe endabatisa na bandu boti bendakunnyendelya!” <verse eid="JHN 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27" />Yoani ngayangwa, “Mundu akombwali ba na kili'be sosoti, pangali peyelwa na Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28" />Mwenga mwabene mwaakong'ondeli bangu' naabaite panga, ‘Nenga na Kilisitu li, ila nitumilwe li'nga ninnongoli.’ <verse eid="JHN 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29" />Nkobeki nga mwene mwali' ywaku'nda. Lakini mbwigalye nkobeki ywayi'ma papipi nakwe pi'kania lilobe lyake bai, endapulaika muno. Nyinyonyo, pulaa yangu' itimile kwa mwanjaa ywembe ywa ngama kulikoni nenga. <verse eid="JHN 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30" />Ywembe ipalikwa au'bu'ke, nenga niuluke.”<verse eid="JHN 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ywaisa bu'ka kunani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31" />Ywaisa bu'ka kunani nga nku'lu' wa boti. Lakini ywai ywa padunia, ywa padunia, nembe alongela makowe ga padunia. Ywembe ywaisa bu'ka kunani nga nku'lu' wa boti. <verse eid="JHN 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32" />Ywembe alongela gaagabweni na kugayu'wa, lakini ntu'pu' mundu ywayi'ki'tya gaagakong'ondelya. <verse eid="JHN 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33" />Lakini mundu ywoywoti ywayi'ki'tya gaagakong'ondelya, ayi'ki'tya panga Nnu'ngu' nga kweli. <verse eid="JHN 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34" />Yu'lu' ywatumilwe na Nnu'ngu' alongela mayi'gi'yo ga Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa Nnu'ngu' annyalya Loo wake mundu ywo wangali li'ngi'lya. <verse eid="JHN 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35" />Tati' bampendi Mwana, nabembe bankamwiye ili'be yoti mumaboko gake. <verse eid="JHN 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36" />Ywoywoti ywamwu'bi'lya Mwana, ukoto wake waayomokali, lakini yu'lu' ywankana Mwana aaupatali ukoto wo, na nyongo ya Nnu'ngu' yabaa panani yake.<verse eid="JHN 3:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na nnwawa Nsamalia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1" />Mafalisayo baayu'wine panga Yesu endebatisa no pata banamasi' baingi kulikoni Yoani. <verse eid="JHN 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2" />Lakini ywabatisage aai Yesu mwene lili, baai banamasi' bake. <verse eid="JHN 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3" />Yesu paayu'wine makowe go, aabu'i Yudea no buyangania kai' Galilaya. <verse eid="JHN 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4" />Bai mwanja wo aapalikwe pi'tya kunkoa wa Samalia.<verse eid="JHN 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5" />Ngaika kukilambo simo sa ku Samalia sakikemelwa Sukali papipi na nng'unda wa Yakobi waampei mwana wake Yusupu. <verse eid="JHN 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6" />Pandu po, nga palwabile lu'si' lwa Yakobi. Naywembe Yesu aabile atotokilwe kwa mwanja, ngatama pambwega ya lu'si'. Lisu'ba lyaai musaa sita muntwekati.<verse eid="JHN 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7" />Ngaisa nnwawa yumo Nsamalia teka masi'. Yesu ngammakia, “Nilu'ba masi' ninywe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8" />(Wakati wo, banamasi' bake baayi'i kumisengo pi'ma kilyo.) <figure style="fig" alt="Samaritan woman at well - DN00433" file="SamaritanWomanAtWell_John4.1-42_DN00433.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="4:8" /><verse eid="JHN 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9" />Yu'lu' nnwawa ngannyangwa, “Wenga wa Nnyahudi nanenga na nnwawa Nsamalia. Kwa buli unilu'ba nikupei masi' go nywa?” (Kwa mwanjaa Ayahudi bayangabanikali na Asamalia.) <verse eid="JHN 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Kenda ukatanga sawesa kupeya Nnu'ngu' na nyai ywakulu'ba umpei masi' go nywa, wenga ulu'e kunnu'ba ywembe na alu'e kupeya masi' gagaleta ukoto.” <verse eid="JHN 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11" />Yu'lu' nnwawa ngannyangwa, “Bwana, wenga ntu'pu' nnobo wo tekya, na lu'si' lu' luyendekeya. Ulu'a gapata kwaku' ago masi' ga ukoto? <verse eid="JHN 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12" />Kwani wenga wampi'ndo kulikoni au'ku' bitu Yakobi, ywembe ngaywatupei lu'si' lu' lwalwaampwaike ywembe na bana bake, na myugo yake yendenywa?” <verse eid="JHN 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Kila mundu ywanywa masi' ga lu'si' lu' aaminya nnyota kai'. <verse eid="JHN 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14" />Lakini ywaalu'a nywa masi' ganaampeya nenga, aaibonali nnyota milele. Masi' ganaampeya ne, nkati yake sabaa kinywanyu sa masi' ga ukoto na kumpeya ukoto wangayomoka.” <verse eid="JHN 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15" />Aywo nnwawa ngammakia, “Bwana, unipei ago masi', li'nga nakane minya nnyota kai', na kanenise pano palu'si' teka masi'.” <verse eid="JHN 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16" />Yesu ngammakia, “Uyende ukankeme nsengogo, wise nakwe pano.”<verse eid="JHN 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17" />Aywo nnwawa ngammakia, “Nenga ntu'pu' nnalu'me,” Yesu ngammakia, “Golongei kakape panga wenga nnalu'me ntu'pu'. <verse eid="JHN 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18" />Kwa mwanjaa uyomwike tama na analu'me batano na ywotama nakwe nambi'yambi' nsengogo li, apo ulongei kakape.” <verse eid="JHN 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19" />Yu'lu' nnwawa ngabaya, “Bwana, ibonekana mpu'la bai panga, wenga wa nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20" />Api'ndo bitu bankilikityage Nnu'ngu' panani ya kitu'mbi' si'no, lakini mwenga mubaya panga pandu pakunkilikitya Nnu'ngu' ku'lu' ku Yelusalemu.”<verse eid="JHN 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21" />Yesu ngammakia, “Mau', muniu'bi'li panga nsimu wendaisa, nsimu wo ntu'pu' pabaalu'a kwakilikitya Tati' panani ya kitu'mbi' si', ata ku'lu' ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22" />Mwenga mwa Asamalia, muntangiteli ywamunkilikitya. Twayahudi tuntangite Nnu'ngu' ywatunkilikitya kwa mwanjaa ukosopoli wisi kwa ndi'la ya Ayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23" />Lakini nsimu wendaisa, kai' uyomwike isa, babaankilikitya Nnu'ngu' kwa kakape, baakilikitya Tati' kwa loo na kakape. Kwa mwanjaa Tati' bapala bandu babankilikitya Nnu'ngu' kwa nyo. <verse eid="JHN 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24" />Nnu'ngu' nga loo, na bandu boti babankilikitya, bapalikwa bankilikiti kwa loo na kweli.” <verse eid="JHN 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25" />Yu'lu' nnwawa ngammakia, “Nitangite panga Masiya, ywakemelwa Kilisitu, endaisa. Paaisa, aatubakia kila kikowe.” <verse eid="JHN 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26" />Yesu ngammakia, “Nenga nanilongela nawenga nga na Masiya wene.”<verse eid="JHN 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27" />Palongelage na nnwawa ywo, banamasi' bake baai kababuyangana. Baatisangala muno kummona kalongela na nnwawa. Lakini ntu'pu' ywannalwiye, “Upala namani kwa nnwawa yu'?” Au, “Mwanjaa namani ulongela na nnwawa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 4:27">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Samaritan woman calling friends - CN01675" file="SamaritanWomanCallingFriends_John4.28-29_CN01675.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="4:27" /> <verse eid="JHN 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28" />Yu'lu' nnwawa aakilei kibi'ga sake no buyangania kumisengo na kwabakia bandu, <verse eid="JHN 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29" />“Mwise samunnole mundu ywanibakiye kila kili'be sanikipangite! Buli, iwesa panga kwaali' ayu' nga Kilisitu?” <verse eid="JHN 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30" />Bai, bandu ngabakongolekana bu'ka mumisengo kunnyendelya Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31" />Akwo nsu'gu' banamasi' baatikumpembelelya kababaya, “Mwalimu, ulye.” <verse eid="JHN 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32" />Lakini ywembe ngaabakia, “Nenga nibile na kilyo samukotwike kitanga mwenga.” <verse eid="JHN 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33" />Bai, banamasi' ngabatumbwa laluyana, “Kubile na mundu ywanneti kilyo?” <verse eid="JHN 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Kilyo sangu' panga si'lu' sapala ywanitumike no timisa lyengo lyake. <verse eid="JHN 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35" />Mwenga mubaya, ‘Igali myei mine bai ika nsimu wo una.’ Lakini nenga nimmakianga, mutu'ndu'bi'ye minyo ginu mulinguli yakulya mumigunda mwaiyei, ili'nda unilwa. <verse eid="JHN 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36" />Ywauna apata mbokoboko yake, na akongwa yakulya no bi'ka muukoto wangayomoka, li'nga yu'lu' ywapanda na ywauna, banapusike pamope. <verse eid="JHN 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37" />Kwa nyo nnongelo wu' wa kakape, ‘Apandi bi'ngi', Auni bi'ngi'.’ <verse eid="JHN 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38" />Nenga nintumike mukaune yakulya yangaaukilya. Bi'ngi' baapangite kasi, lakini mwenga mupata bu'ka mulyusu lyabe.”<verse eid="JHN 4:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39" />Asamalia baingi ba kilambo si'lu' bamwu'bi'li kwa kitumbu sa makowe gaalongei aywo nnwawa, “Anibakiye makowe goti ganigapangite.” <verse eid="JHN 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40" />Kwa nyo balu' Asamalia bannyendeli Yesu na kunnu'ba atame nabo, nembe ngatama po masu'ba gabi'li'. <verse eid="JHN 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41" />Bandu baingi baatiu'bi'lya kwa kitumbu sa liyi'gi'yo lyake Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42" />Ngabammakia yu'lu' nnwawa, “Tuu'bi'lile lelo, kwenda kwa makowe gako bai lili, ila kwa mwanjaa tunnyu'wine twabene. Tutangite kakape panga ayu' nga Nkosopoli wa dunia.”<verse eid="JHN 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana wa mpi'ndo wa silikali endatepulwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43" />Pagapite galu' masu'ba gabi'li', Yesu aatibu'ka yenda ku Galilaya, <verse eid="JHN 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44" />mwanjaa Yesu mwene aalongei mpu'la panga, “Nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' aisimilwali panni'ma wake.” <verse eid="JHN 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45" />Bai paikite Galilaya, Agalilaya baingi baatikunkemya, kwa mwanjaa nabembe baabile kusi'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Pasika, baagabweni makowe gagapangite Yesu akwo Yelusalemu ku Pasika.<verse eid="JHN 4:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46" />Yesu aaikite kai' kukilambo sa kana, kunkoa wa Galilaya, pandu paagalambwiye masi' panga divai. Kwaabile na mpi'ndo yumo wa silikali ywaabile na mwana ntamwe akwo ku Kapernaumu. <verse eid="JHN 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47" />Bai, aywo mundu paayu'wine panga Yesu aaisi popo pa Galilaya bu'ka ku Yudea, aatikunnyendelya na kunnu'ba aise antepwe mwana wake ywaabile ntamwe katetelya. <verse eid="JHN 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48" />Yesu ngammakia, “Mwabandu mwenga mana mukotwike kwibona myasu na mangelongelo mwau'bi'lyali katu.” <verse eid="JHN 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49" />Yu'lu' mpi'ndo wa silikali ngammakia, “Bwana, nikulu'ba wise mwana wangu' abile balo anawaali.” <verse eid="JHN 4:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50" />Yesu ngammakia, “Uyende bai, mwana wako ayu'yu'kilwe.” Aywo mundu ngau'bi'lya gaalongei Yesu, ngabu'ka. <verse eid="JHN 4:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51" />Paabile mundi'la aakwembine na atumisi bake ngabammakia panga, mwana wake aai mwu'mi. <verse eid="JHN 4:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52" />Nembe ngalaluya saa yayu'yu'kilwe mwana, ngabammakia, “Oma wammu'i liso musaa saba ya muntwekati.” <verse eid="JHN 4:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53" />Abo tati' ba mwana ngabaku'mbu'kya panga ayo nga yai saa yabakiyilwe na Yesu, “Mwana wako ayu'yu'kilwe.” Kwa nyo ywembe pamope na boti ba panyumba yake ngabamwu'bi'lya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 4:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54" />Awo waai mwasu wenebi'li' waupangite Yesu kabu'ka Yudea yenda Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 4:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu antepwa mundu papipi na litanda lya masi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Paralyzed man at pool - WA03828" file="ParalyzedManAtPool_John5.3-7_WA03828.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="5:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1" />Bu'ka pa go kwai na si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Ayahudi, nembe Yesu ngayenda ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2" />Akwo Yelusalemu papipi na nniango waukemelwa Nniango wa Ngondolo, kwabile na litanda lya masi' lyalyaakemilwe kwa Kiebrania Bethzatha. Litanda lyo lyati'li'ti'yilwe na yega tano. <verse eid="JHN 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3" />Apo paai na bandu masikini baingi, atu'lu'ka minyo, itewe na babatombolwike, bali'ndage masi' gayu'geyu'ge. <verse eid="JHN 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:4" />Kwa mwanjaa malaika wa Bwana aaulwike kwo kokotya nkati ya li'lu' litanda, na kugatingibwana masi'. Ntamwe ywalongolya yingya nkati ya litanda masi' pagatingibwanilwa, utamwe wowoti waminyage, waatibu'ka. <verse eid="JHN 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5" />Bai, apo paabile na mundu yumo ywai ntamwe kwa myaka salasini na minane. <verse eid="JHN 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6" />Yesu paamweni aywo mundu agonjike, naywembe aatangite panga aabile ntamwe kwa myaka yambone ngammakia, “Upala ube wankoto?” <verse eid="JHN 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7" />Yu'lu' ntamwe ngayangwa, “Bwana, nenga ntu'pu' mundu wa kuniyingiya mulitanda, masi' pagatingibwanilwa. Kila pagatingibwanilwa, nipaya yingya nkati ya masi', mundu ywi'ngi' anilongolya yingya.” <verse eid="JHN 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8" />Yesu ngammakia, “Uyi'me witwi'ke likai lyako, uyende kwa magu'lu' gako.” <verse eid="JHN 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9" />Imukya, yu'lu' mundu atepulilwe ngatola likai lyake no tumbwa yenda. Likowe lyo lyapangike lisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10" />Kwa nyo, bi'ngi' ba api'ndo ba Ayahudi bammakiye aywo mundu ywatepulilwe, “Li'no lisu'ba lya Sabato, iyi'ki'ti'lwali pu'twa likai lyako.”<verse eid="JHN 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11" />Lakini ywembe ngaabakia, “Yu'lu' mundu ywanitepwile ngaywanibakiye, ‘Upu'twe likai lyako uyende.’” <verse eid="JHN 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12" />Nabembe ngabannaluya, “Nyai ywakubakiye ‘Upu'twe likai lyako uyende?’” <verse eid="JHN 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13" />Bai, yu'lu' mundu ywatepulilwe aantangiteli mundu ywantepwile, kwa mwanjaa Yesu aayomwike bu'ka kwa kinunu pandu po pabaatwi'li bandu. <verse eid="JHN 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14" />Bu'kapo Yesu aankwembite yu'lu' mundu ywantepwile munyumba ya Nnu'ngu' ngammakia, “Nambi'yambi' uponi, kaneupange sambi kai', lyaakane kupata likowe lyakau pi'ta li'.” <verse eid="JHN 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15" />Yu'lu' mundu ngayenda kwabakia api'ndo ba Ayahudi panga Yesu ngaywanitepwile.<verse eid="JHN 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16" />Kwa nyo, api'ndo ba Ayahudi baatumbwi kunku'su'mbwa kwa mwanjaa apangage makowe go lisu'ba lya Sabato yabe. <verse eid="JHN 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Tati' bangu' bapanga kasi kila lisu'ba, kwa nyo nanenga nganipanga.”<verse eid="JHN 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18" />Kwa kitumbu sa makowe ga, api'ndo ba Ayahudi baapalike kila ndi'la ya kummulaga Yesu, kwenda kwa kitumbu sa kwiti'kwana Sabato bai lili, ila kwa kunkema Nnu'ngu' Tati' bake naywembe abile nsawani nakwe.<verse eid="JHN 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uweso wa Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Kakape nendakummakianga, Mwana akombwali panga likowe lya kisake. Ywembe apanga li'lu' lyaabona Tati' bake kabapanga, kwa mwanjaa lyolyoti lyalipangilwa na Tati', Mwana alipanga nyinyonyo. <verse eid="JHN 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20" />Mwanjaa Tati' bampenda Mwana na kunnaya galu' gabagapanga bene Tati', naywembe alu'a kunnaya lyengo liku'lu' kulikoni li', li'nga musangale. <verse eid="JHN 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21" />Kati mwaibile Tati' kwayu'ya babawile na kwapeya ukoto, nyinyonyo na Mwana kwapeya ukoto bandu kati mwapala. <verse eid="JHN 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22" />Kai' Tati' bansenwali mundu ywoywoti, ila bampei Mwana uweso woti wo senwa, <verse eid="JHN 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23" />li'nga bandu boti bamwisimu Mwana kati mu'lu' mwabaaisimu Tati'. Ywakana kumwisimu Mwana, akana kwaisimu Tati' babaantumike Mwana.<verse eid="JHN 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24" />“Kakape nimmakianga, ywayu'wa liyi'gi'yo lyangu' na kumwu'bi'lya yu'lu' ywanitumike abile na ukoto wangayomoka. Alu'a senulwali katu, ila ayomwike pi'ta bu'ka mukiwo no yingya muukoto. <verse eid="JHN 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25" />Kakape nimmakianga, nsimu wendaisa, kai' wisile panga babawile baaliyu'wa lilobe lya Mwana wa Nnu'ngu', na babaaliyu'wa lilobe lyo baapanga bau'mi. <verse eid="JHN 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26" />Kati Tati' mwababile kitumbu sa bwu'mi, nyinyonyo bannyali Mwana uweso wo piya ukoto kwa bi'ngi'. <verse eid="JHN 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27" />Kai', ampeile Mwana wake utawala wo senwa, kwa mwanjaa ywembe Mwana wa Mundu. <verse eid="JHN 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28" />Kanemusangale yu'wa makowe gano, kwa mwanjaa saa yendaisa payapanga bababile mumasiko baaliyu'wa lilobe lyake, <verse eid="JHN 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29" />nabembe baayu'ka. Balu' babaapangite manogau baayu'ka no tama bau'mi, balu' babaapangite malau baayu'ka no senulwa.<verse eid="JHN 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akong'ondeli ba Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30" />“Nenga nikombwali panga kikowe sosoti kwa makakala gangu' namwene. Mwaniyu'wa, nga mwanisenwa. Nisenwa kwa aki, kwa mwanjaa nipalali panga ganipala namwene, ila nipanga mwabapala Tati' babaanitumike. <verse eid="JHN 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31" />Mana kaniikong'ondelya namwene, ukong'ondeli wangu' uyi'ki'ti'lwali panga wa kakape. <verse eid="JHN 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32" />Lakini kubile na ywi'ngi' ywanikong'ondelya, nanenga nitangite panga kong'ondelya kwake kwa kakape. <verse eid="JHN 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33" />Mwenga mwatumike bandu kwa Yoani, nembe ngaikong'ondeli kweli. <verse eid="JHN 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34" />Nenga niu'bi'lyali ukong'ondeli wa mundu, ila nilibaya li', li'nga mwenga mukosopolelwe. <verse eid="JHN 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35" />Yoani aai kati lumuli lwaluyakage no piya bweya, namwenga pamuubweni bweya wake, ngamunapusika na awo bweya kwa mpi'to. <verse eid="JHN 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36" />Lakini nenga namwene nibile na ukong'ondeli wangu' nku'lu' kulikoni wu'lu' wa Yoani. Kwa mwanjaa mengo ganigapanga nga galu' gabanitumike Tati' nigatimise. Yani mangelongelo gakong'ondelya panga Tati' ngabanitumike. <verse eid="JHN 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37" />Na Tati' babaanitumike bakong'ondeli bu'kana na nenga. Wala munayu'wali katu lilobe lyabe, ata kwaabona mwababile, <verse eid="JHN 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38" />kai', mwenga muliyi'ki'tili liyi'gi'yo lyake, kwa mwanjaa mumwu'bi'li li ywembe ywantumike. <verse eid="JHN 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39" />Mwenga mupekeseni Maandiko Mapeleteu mukitage nkati yake mulu'a pata ukoto wangayomoka, kumbe Maandiko gogogo nga gaganikong'ondelya nenga. <verse eid="JHN 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40" />Lakini mwenga mukana kuniu'bi'lya nenga li'nga mupate ukoto.<verse eid="JHN 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41" />“Nenga nipalali lumbilwa na bandu. <verse eid="JHN 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42" />Lakini nintangite mwenga, panga mumpendili Nnu'ngu' mumyoyo yinu. <verse eid="JHN 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43" />Nenga niisi kwa utawala wa Tati' bangu', lakini munipokili. Ila mundu ywi'ngi' mana aisi kwa utawala wake mwene, mwampokya. <verse eid="JHN 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44" />Mwenga mukombwabuli u'bi'lya manaitei mupeyana utukupu mwabene na bene, lakini mubiniali kuupala utukupu waubu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu'? <verse eid="JHN 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45" />Wala kanemuganiye panga nenga nalu'a kunsitakya kwa Tati', abile ywansitakya nga Musa ywamumwu'bi'lya mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46" />Kenda kakape mukamwu'bi'lya Musa, mulu'e niu'bi'lya nanenga, kwa mwanjaa ywembe aandike abali yangu'. <verse eid="JHN 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47" />Lakini manaitei mugau'bi'lyali gaandike Musa, mulu'a gau'bi'lya buli ganigalongela?”<verse eid="JHN 5:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6" />
  <para style="s">Yesu apeya kilyo bandu maelupu matano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat 14:13-21</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mal 6:30-44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9:10-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1" />Bu'ka pa go, Yesu aayi'i kwiyi' ya Baali ya Galilaya, lina li'ngi' ikemelwa Baali ya Tibelia. Yesu aayi'i kwiyi' ya Baali ya Galilaya, lina li'ngi' ikemelwa Baali ya Tibelia. <verse eid="JHN 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2" />Kipi'nga kiku'lu' sa bandu satikummi'ngi'ya, kwa mwanjaa baibweni myasu ya mangelongelo gaagapangite kwa atamwe. <verse eid="JHN 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3" />Nembe Yesu aau'bwike pakitu'mbi', aatami kwo pamope na banamasi' bake. <verse eid="JHN 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4" />Na si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Pasika ya Ayahudi yai kaiegelya. <verse eid="JHN 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5" />Yesu paalingite, na kukibona kipi'nga kiku'lu' sa bandu kakimwisilya, ngammakia Pilipi, “Tukapi'me kwaku' makati li'nga bandu ba bapate lya?” <verse eid="JHN 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6" />Aannalwiye nyo kwa kumpaya, kwa mwanjaa aatangite lyo panga. <verse eid="JHN 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7" />Pilipi ngannyangwa, “Ata mbanje dinali<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:7</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dinali yimo yabile kati mbanje ya kunni'pa kibalua yumo kwa lisu'ba limo.</char></note> mya ibi'li' ili'nganali pi'ma makati ga kwapeya bandu ba walau kila mundu apate king'esu kisene.” <verse eid="JHN 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8" />Yumo ywa banamasi' bake, ywakemilwe Andelea nnunawe Simoni Petili, ngammakia, <verse eid="JHN 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9" />“Pano abile munsembe yumo, abile na makati matano na omba abi'li' asene asene. Lakini ayi' kwa kipi'nga sa bandu ba, alu'a lya nyai, no igala nyai?” <figure style="fig" alt="Loaves &amp; Fish - HK00155" file="Loaves&amp;Fish_HK00155.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="6:9" /><verse eid="JHN 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10" />Yesu ngabaya, “Mwatamike bandu pakitamo.” Pandu po paabile na manyei gambone, na bandu ngabatama. Paabile na analu'me elupu tano. <verse eid="JHN 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11" />Yesu ngatola makati na kunsukulu Nnu'ngu'. Ngatumbwa kwabagana balu' bandu babaabile mwitamo, kila mundu mwapala lya. Aapangite nyinyonyo ata kwa balu' omba. <verse eid="JHN 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12" />Bandu boti pabaayomwi lya no yukuta, ngaabakia banamasi' bake, “Mukongwe ing'esu yoti yaiigile, li'nga yaakane alabika.” <verse eid="JHN 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13" />Bai, ngabakongwa ing'esu yoti ya makati matano yabaigiye balu' bandu, baatwi'liye itu'ndu' ku'mi na ibi'li'. <figure style="fig" alt="Feeding the 5000 - WA03856" file="FeedingThe5000(4000)-5CollectingLeftovers_WA03856.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="6:13" /><verse eid="JHN 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14" />Bandu pabaubweni mwasu waupangite Yesu, ngababaya, “Kakape ayu' nga yu'lu' Nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' ywaisa padunia!” <verse eid="JHN 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15" />Yesu pakwipwi panga bapalage isa bampange nkulungwa wabe kwa makakala, ngaegela pabaabile ngayenda pakitu'mbi' ywembe kisake.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 6:15">Yesu ayenda kwa magu'lu' panani ya masi'</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 6:15">(<ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mat 14:22-33</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Mal 6:45-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 6:15">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus walking on water - CN01720" file="JesusWalkingOnWater_CN01720.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="6:15" /> <verse eid="JHN 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16" />Paiikite kitamwiyo, banamasi' bake baaeleli kulitanda liku'lu'. <verse eid="JHN 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17" />Baayingi mungalaba, baatumbwi loka litanda liku'lu' yenda Kapernaumu. Saa yo yaai ya lubi'ndu' na Yesu aai anakwembanali nabo. <verse eid="JHN 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18" />Na litanda liku'lu' lyendetikatika kwa kitumbu sa nsunga nkali' waupukatyage. <verse eid="JHN 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19" />Banamasi' pabayi'i kilometa tano au sita, ngabammona Yesu kayenda na magu'lu' panani ya masi' kaiegelya ngalaba, ngabayogopa muno. <verse eid="JHN 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Nenga pano, kanemuyogope.” <verse eid="JHN 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21" />Bai, bapalage kumpu'twa Yesu mungalaba yabe, baimukya, ngalaba iikite kuuyu'mu' kwabayendage.<verse eid="JHN 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu bampala Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22" />Pammalau' yake, kipi'nga sa bandu babaigile liyi' lyenebi'li' lya litanda baatangite panga palu' kwabile na ngalaba yimo bai, na Yesu aalongwaniyeli nabo mungalaba yo, ila banamasi' bo baayi'i kisabe. <verse eid="JHN 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23" />Lakini ngalaba yi'ngi' bu'ka Tibelia yaikite papipi na palu' pabaalile makati, bu'ka pa Yesu kunsukulu Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24" />Bai, abo bandu pabakwipwi panga Yesu na banamasi' bake baabileli pandu po, ngabau'bu'ka mungalaba yenda Kapernaumu kumpala.<verse eid="JHN 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu likati lya ukoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25" />Balu' bandu pabankwembite Yesu kwiyi' ya litanda baatikunnaluya, “Mwalimu, waikite pakubawi pano?” <verse eid="JHN 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Kakape nimmakianga, munipalali kwa kitumbu sa myasu ya mangelongelo gamugabweni, ila munipala kwa mwanjaa mwaalile galu' makati no yukuta. <verse eid="JHN 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27" />Kanemuyomwe malango ginu kwo panga lyengo kwa kilyo sakilu'la, muganiye no panga lyengo kwa kilyo sangalu'la sakimpeyanga ukoto wangayomoka. Mwana wa Mundu, ywakong'ondelilwe na Nnu'ngu', alu'a kumpeya kilyo so.” <verse eid="JHN 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28" />Nabembe ngabannaluya, “Tupange buli li'nga tukombwe kugapanga mengo ga Nnu'ngu'?” <verse eid="JHN 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Li'no nga lyengo lyalipala Nnu'ngu' mulipange, kumwu'bi'lya yu'lu' ywantumike.”<verse eid="JHN 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30" />Apo ngabannaluya, “Ulu'a panga mwasu waku' tuubone li'nga tukuu'bi'li? Ulu'a panga kikowe gani? <verse eid="JHN 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31" />Au'ku' bitu baalile kilyo sasaakemilwe ‘mana’ ku'lu' kulupu'ngu'ti', kati mwagabaya Maandiko, <char style="qt">‘Aapei makati bu'ka kunani li'nga balye</char>.’”<verse eid="JHN 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Kakape nimmakianga, ywampeyangite makati bu'ka kunani Musa lili, ila Tati' bangu' ngabampeyanga makati ga kakape bu'ka kunani. <verse eid="JHN 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33" />Kwa mwanjaa likati lya Nnu'ngu' nga yu'lu' ywauluka bu'ka kunani na kwipeya dunia ukoto.” <verse eid="JHN 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34" />Ngabammakia, “Bwana, utupei alyo likati masu'ba goti.” <verse eid="JHN 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Nenga nga na likati lya ukoto. Ywaisa kasangu' aaminyali njala, na ywaniu'bi'lya, katu, aaminyali nnyota. <verse eid="JHN 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36" />Lakini kati mwanimmakiye, pamope no panga munibweni lakini mwu'bi'lyali. <verse eid="JHN 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37" />Balu' boti baanipeya Tati' baaisa kasangu', na ywoywoti ywaisa kasangu', katu nankanali. <verse eid="JHN 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38" />Kwa mwanjaa niulwike bu'ka kunani li'nga nipange ganipala lili, ila nipange gapala ywembe ywanitumike. <verse eid="JHN 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39" />Aga nga gapala ywembe ywanitumike, panga kanenimwobeye ata yumo ywa balu' baanipeile, ila naayu'ye lisu'ba lya kuundi'la. <verse eid="JHN 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40" />Kwa mwanjaa sabapala Tati' bangu' nga si'no, kila ywammona Mwana na kumwu'bi'lya abe na ukoto wangayomoka, nanenga nalu'a kunnyu'ya lisu'ba lya kuundi'la.”<verse eid="JHN 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41" />Bai, Ayahudi baatumbwi ku'ku'li'ka kwa mwanjaa Yesu aabakiye panga ywembe nga likati lyaliulwike bu'ka kunani. <verse eid="JHN 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42" />Ngababaya, “Ayu' mwana wa Yusupu li, tati' bake na mau' bake batwatangite? Akombwabuli baya, ‘Niulwike bu'ka kunani?’” <verse eid="JHN 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Kanemuku'ku'li'kyane mwaboti mwabamo. <verse eid="JHN 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44" />Ntu'pu' mundu ywakombwa isa kasangu' mpaka autilwe na Tati' bangu' babanitumike, nanenga nannyu'ya lisu'ba lya kuundi'la. <verse eid="JHN 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45" />Alondoli ba Nnu'ngu' baatiandika, <char style="qt">‘Bandu boti baayi'ganilwa na Nnu'ngu'.’</char> Kila mundu ywaayu'wa na kwiyi'gana bu'ka kwa Tati', aaisa kasangu'. <verse eid="JHN 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46" />Pano ilombolyali panga kubile na mundu ywoywoti ywaabweni Tati', ila yu'lu' ywaumi kwa Nnu'ngu', aywo ngaywaabweni Tati'. <verse eid="JHN 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47" />Kakape nimmakianga, ywau'bi'lya abile na ukoto wangayomoka. <verse eid="JHN 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48" />Nenga nga na likati lya ukoto. <verse eid="JHN 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49" />Au'ku' binu baalile kilyo sasaakemilwe ‘mana’ ku'lu' kulupu'ngu'ti', lakini baawile. <verse eid="JHN 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50" />Lakini ali' likati lyaliuluka bu'ka kunani, lyembe mundu ywoywoti mana alile, aawali. <verse eid="JHN 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51" />Nenga na likati lya ukoto li'lu' lyalibu'i kunani. Mundu ywoywoti mana alile likati li' alu'a ba na ukoto wangayomoka. Likati li' nga yi'ga yangu' yanaaipiya li'nga dunia ipate ukoto.”<verse eid="JHN 6:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52" />Bai, Ayahudi baatitaukana bene na bene kababaya, “Akombwabuli mundu yu' kutupeya yi'ga yake tulye?” <verse eid="JHN 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53" />Kwa nyo Yesu ngaabakia, “Kakape nimmakianga, mana mukotwike kuilya yi'ga ya Mwana wa Mundu na kuinywa myai yake, kakape mwaalamali. <verse eid="JHN 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54" />Mundu ywoywoti ywailya yi'ga yangu' na kwinywa myai yangu', abi na ukoto wangayomoka. Nane nannyu'ya lisu'ba lya kuundi'la. <verse eid="JHN 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55" />Kwa mwanjaa yi'ga yangu' nga kilyo sa kakape na myai yangu' nga kinywo sa kakape. <verse eid="JHN 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56" />Ywalya yi'ga yangu' na kuinywa myai yangu' aatama nkati yangu' nanenga naatama nkati yake. <verse eid="JHN 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57" />Kati mu'lu' Tati' babanitumike nenga mwababile bau'mi, nanenga nankoti kwa Tati', nyinyonyo nembe ywanilya nenga aapanga nkoto kwa kitumbu sangu'. <verse eid="JHN 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58" />Li'no nga likati lyaliuluka bu'ka kunani, kwenda kati likati li'lu' lyabalile au'ku' binu na baawile. Ywalya likati li', ukoto wake waayomokali.” <verse eid="JHN 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59" />Yesu aalongei makowe go paabile kayi'gana munyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' akwo ku Kapernaumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:59" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mayi'gi'yo gagaleta ukoto wangayomoka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60" />Baingi ba banamasi' bake pabaayu'wine likowe li' ngababaya, “Mayi'gano ga ganonwipe. Nyai ywakombwa kugapokya?” <verse eid="JHN 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61" />Yesu aatangite panga banamasi' bake bendaku'ku'li'ka bu'kana na mayi'gano gake, ngaabakia, “Kitiwi, likowe li' limpanga muku'bale? <verse eid="JHN 6:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62" />Ilu'e panga buli, mukammona Mwana wa Mundu kau'bu'ka buyangania kwaumi? <verse eid="JHN 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63" />Loo wa Nnu'ngu' nga ywaleta ukoto, yi'ga ipwaikali. Makowe ga ganimmakiye nga Loo na ukoto. <verse eid="JHN 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64" />Lakini mwabi'ngi' binu muu'bi'lyali.” (Mwanjaa Yesu aatangite bu'ka patumbu balu' babaalu'a kana kumwu'bi'lya pakati yabe, na yu'lu' ywaalu'a kunsongya.) <verse eid="JHN 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65" />Aayendeli baya, “Asi' nga kitumbu sanammakiye panga ntu'pu' mundu ywakombwa isa kasangu' ila yu'lu' ywayaliwite na Tati' bangu'.”<verse eid="JHN 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66" />Bu'ka lisu'ba lyo, apwasi bake baingi baabuyangani nsu'gu', na baalongwaniyeli nakwe kai'. <verse eid="JHN 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67" />Kwa nyo, Yesu aalalwiye balu' banamasi' bake ku'mi na abi'li', “Buli, namwenga mpala bu'ka kai'?” <verse eid="JHN 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68" />Simoni Petili ngannyangwa, “Bwana, tubu'ke tuyende kwa nyai? Wenga ubile na mayi'gi'yo ga ukoto wangayomoka. <verse eid="JHN 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69" />Twenga twendau'bi'lya no tanga panga wenga nga wa Mpeleteu wa Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="JHN 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Buli, ninsawangiteli mwenga ku'mi na abi'li'? Ata nyo, yumo mukipi'nga sinu nga moka!” <verse eid="JHN 6:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71" />Yesu aalongei go bu'kana na Yuda, mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti, kwa mwanjaa ayu' ngaywaalu'a kunsongya, pamope no panga aai yumo ywa balu' ku'mi na abi'li'.<verse eid="JHN 6:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu na alongobe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1" />Bu'ka pa makowe go, Yesu aayi'i tyangilya ku Galilaya. Aakani yenda kunkoa wa Yudea, kwa mwanjaa api'ndo ba Ayahudi bapalage kummulaga. <verse eid="JHN 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2" />Si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Ibanda ya Ayahudi yai kaiegelya. <verse eid="JHN 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3" />Bai, anunabe ngabammakia, “Ubu'ke pano, uyende Yudea li'nga banamasi' bako bakagabone mengo gaugapanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4" />Mundu mana kapala tanganikwa, apangali makowe gake kwo iya. Mana kaupanga makowe ga, wilaye kwa dunia.” <verse eid="JHN 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5" />(Kwa mwanjaa anunabe baamwu'bi'li lili.) <verse eid="JHN 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Wakati wangu' waupwaika balo unatimyali, lakini kwinu mwenga kila wakati wendapwaika. <verse eid="JHN 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7" />Dunia ikombwali kunsukwa mwenga, lakini dunia inisukwa nenga kwa mwanjaa naakong'ondelya makowe maakau gabapanga. <verse eid="JHN 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8" />Mwenga muyende kusi'li'ku'si'li'ku' yo. Nenga niyendali, kwa mwanjaa wakati waupwaika kwangu' nenga unaikali.” <verse eid="JHN 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9" />Nembe payomwi kwabakia makowe go, aaigali ku Galilaya.<verse eid="JHN 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kusi'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Ibanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10" />Lakini anunabe pabaabu'i yenda kusi'li'ku'si'li'ku', nembe Yesu aayi'i, lakini kwa kinunu. <verse eid="JHN 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11" />Api'ndo ba Ayahudi baabile kabampala akwo kusi'li'ku'si'li'ku' no laluyana, “Ayu' mundu ai kwaku'?”<verse eid="JHN 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12" />Kwaabile na bandu kabataunana makutu pandu po pabaamesekine bandu bu'kana na Yesu, bandu bi'ngi' kababaya, “Mundu nnogau,” bi'ngi' kababaya, “Lili, ywembe aakonga bandu.” <verse eid="JHN 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13" />Lakini ntu'pu' mundu ywaalongei mpu'la bu'kana na ywembe, kwa mwanjaa baayogopage api'ndo ba Ayahudi.<verse eid="JHN 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14" />Pakati ya si'li'ku'si'li'ku', Yesu aatiu'bu'ka yenda muluwa lwa nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', ngatumbwa yi'gana. <verse eid="JHN 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15" />Ayahudi baatisangala mu'lu' mwayi'ganage, ngababaya, “Mundu yu' akombwi buli kugamanya makowe ga pangali yi'ganilwa?” <verse eid="JHN 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Mayi'gano gangu' gabu'ka kwangu' namwene lili, ila kwa yu'lu' ywanitumike. <verse eid="JHN 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17" />Mundu ywoywoti mana kapanga mwapala Nnu'ngu', alu'a tanga panga mayi'gano gangu' gabu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu', au nilongela ga pamwoyo wangu' namwene. <verse eid="JHN 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18" />Balu' babalongela kwa kitumbu sabe bene bapanga nyo kwo linga utukupu wabe bene. Lakini ywembe ywapala utukupu wa yu'lu' ywantumike nga ywa kakape, ata ubu'su' ntu'pu' nkati yake. <verse eid="JHN 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19" />Buli, Musa ampeyangiteli mwenga salya? Lakini ntu'pu' ata yumo ywinu ywaikamwa salya. Mwanjaa namani mupala kunibulaga?” <verse eid="JHN 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20" />Si'lu' kipi'nga sa bandu ngakinnyangwa, “Wenga ubile na moka! Nyai ywapala kukubulaga?”<verse eid="JHN 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Nipangite lyengo limo lisu'ba lya Sabato na mwaboti mutisangala. <verse eid="JHN 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22" />Lakini kwa mwanjaa Musa aampeyangite amuli ya liku'mbi', (pamope no panga yaumili kwa Musa, ila yaumi kwa kiu'ku'lu' binu) muina bana ata lisu'ba lya Sabato. <verse eid="JHN 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23" />Manaitei mundu awesa inilwa lisu'ba lya Sabato li'nga salya ya Musa yakane ti'kwanilwa, alyo, likowe lisene bai, mwanjaa namani mwenga muniusikya nenga kwa kuntepwa mundu lisu'ba lyo? <verse eid="JHN 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24" />Kanemusenwe makowe kati mwamugalola kunja bai, ila musenwe kwa aki.”<verse eid="JHN 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buli, ayu' nga Kilisitu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25" />Bai, bandu bi'ngi' ba Yelusalemu ngababaya, “Buli, ayu' nga yu'lu' ywabampala bammulage lili? <verse eid="JHN 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26" />Mboni abile pano alongela pabandu na bamakiali kikowe sosoti? Kwaali' alongosi batangite panga ayu' nga Kilisitu? <verse eid="JHN 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27" />Lakini mundu yu' tutangite kwabu'ka, Kilisitu palu'a isa, ntu'pu' ywoywoti ywalu'a tanga kwabu'ka.”<verse eid="JHN 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28" />Yesu aayendeli yi'gana mu Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', aau'bwiye lilobe kabaya, “Mwenga munitangite no tanga kwanibu'ka. Nenga niisili kwa kitumbu sangu' namwene, ila ywembe ywanitumike ywa kakape, na mwenga muntangiteli. <verse eid="JHN 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29" />Lakini nenga nintangite, kwa mwanjaa nibu'ka kasake naywembe ngaywanitumike.”<verse eid="JHN 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30" />Ngabapala kummoywa, lakini ntu'pu' mundu ywoywoti ywapayite kunkunywa, kwa mwanjaa saa yake yai inaikali. <verse eid="JHN 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31" />Na bandu baingi palu' pakipi'nga sa bandu ngabamwu'bi'lya, ngababaya, “Buli, Kilisitu paaisa, alu'a laya myasu miku'lu' kulikoni yaapangite mundu yu'?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 7:31">Ali'ndi'li batumilwa kummoywa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 7:31">
    <figure style="fig" alt="High priest ordering guards - CN01737" file="HighPriestOrderingGuards_CN01737.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="7:31" /> <verse eid="JHN 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32" />Mafalisayo baayu'wine bandu kabayu'yu'ta makowe kati go bu'kana na Yesu, ngapo bembe pamope na api'ndo ba dini ngabatuma ali'ndi'li li'nga bakammoywe. <verse eid="JHN 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33" />Yesu ngabaya, “Nenga balo nibile pamope na mwenga kwa masu'ba masini, bu'kapo nabuyangania kasake ywembe ywanitumike. <verse eid="JHN 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34" />Mwanipala lakini mwanibonali, kwa mwanjaa mukombwali ika pandu panalu'a ba.” <verse eid="JHN 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35" />Api'ndo ba Ayahudi baatilaluyana bene na bene, “Mundu yu' apala yenda kwaku' kwangali twenga kombwa kumpata? Buli, apala yenda kwa Agiliki, kwembe bi'ngi' ba bandu bitu baayi'i kwo akaayi'gane? <verse eid="JHN 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36" />Ywembe alombolya ki'li' pabaya, ‘Mwanipala lakini mwanibonali, kwa mwanjaa mukombwali ika pandu panalu'a ba’?”<verse eid="JHN 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabi'ndi' ga masi' ga ukoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37" />Lisu'ba lya kuundi'la ya si'li'ku'si'li'ku' lisu'ba li'lu' liku'lu', Yesu aatiyi'ma no u'bu'ya lilobe lyake kabaya, “Manaitei mundu ywoywoti aminya nnyota, aise kasangu' anywe. <verse eid="JHN 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38" />Kati mwagabaya Maandiko Mapeleteu, ‘Ywaniu'bi'lya nenga, <char style="qt">mabi'ndi' ga masi' ga ukoto gaabutuka bu'ka mumwoyo wake.</char>’” <verse eid="JHN 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39" />Yesu paabaike ga, alombolyage Loo Mpeleteu ywaapokelelwa na boti babamwu'bi'li Yesu. Kwa nsimu wu'lu' Loo aai balo anatumilwali, kwa mwanjaa Yesu aai balo anakwi'yi'lwali.<verse eid="JHN 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baganika kwa bandu bu'kana na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40" />Pabayu'wine makowe go, bandu bi'ngi' mukipi'nga si'lu' ngababaya, “Kakape ayu' nga yu'lu' Nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="JHN 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41" />Bi'ngi' baatibaya, “Ayu' nga Kilisitu!” Lakini bi'ngi' baatilaluya, “Ilu'e wesekana buli Kilisitu aume ku Galilaya? <verse eid="JHN 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42" />Maandiko Mapeleteu gabayali panga Kilisitu aabelekwa bu'ka mulukolo lwa Daudi akwo Betelehemu, kukilambo saatamage Daudi?” <verse eid="JHN 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43" />Kwa nyo, bandu baatibaganika kwa kitumbu sa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44" />Bi'ngi' babe bapalage kummoywa, lakini ntu'pu' ywalowite kummoywa.<verse eid="JHN 7:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Alongosi ba Ayahudi bakana kumwu'bi'lya Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45" />Bu'kapo, balu' ali'ndi'li ngababuyangania kwa api'ndo ba dini na Mafalisayo babaatumike kummoywa Yesu, ngabalaluyilwa, “Mwanjaa namani mukotwike kunneta?” <verse eid="JHN 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46" />Ali'ndi'li ngabayangwa, “Tunannyu'wali mundu ywalongela kati mwalongela mundu yu'lu'!” <verse eid="JHN 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47" />Bai, Mafalisayo ngabaalaluya, “Buli, namwenga mukongilwe kai'? <verse eid="JHN 7:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48" />Ywaku' mukipi'nga sa api'ndo bitu au mukipi'nga sa Mafalisayo ywamwu'bi'lile? <verse eid="JHN 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49" />Lakini bandu ba babakotwike tanga salya ya Musa, bakosite lasi.”<verse eid="JHN 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50" />Ngapo Nikodemo, yu'lu' ywaannyendeli Yesu lisu'ba limo nembe aai yumo mukipi'nga sa Mafalisayo, ngalaluya, <verse eid="JHN 7:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51" />“Buli, musalya yitu yendayi'ki'ti'lwa kunsenwa mundu pangali kumpi'kania no tanga sapangite?” <verse eid="JHN 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52" />Nabembe ngabannyangwa, “Buli, nawenga kai' ubu'ka Galilaya? Upekeseni nawenga ulu'a tanga panga ntu'pu' Nnondoli wa Nnu'ngu' ywabu'ka ku Galilaya!”<verse eid="JHN 7:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53" />Bai, kila mundu ngabu'ka yenda kasake.<verse eid="JHN 7:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8" />
  <para style="s">Nnwawa mpege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1" />Kila mundu aabuyangani kasake, lakini Yesu ngayenda mpaka ku Kitu'mbi' sa Minjaituni. <verse eid="JHN 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2" />Pammalau' yake kindai' putiputi, aayi'i kai' munyumba ya Nnu'ngu'. Bandu boti ngabannyendelya, naywembe ngatama no tumbwa kwayi'gana. <verse eid="JHN 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3" />Bai, balimu ba salya na Mafalisayo ngabannetya nnwawa yumo ywaboyolilwe bwalipu, ngabannyi'mi'ka pakatikati yabe. <verse eid="JHN 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4" />Bu'kapo ngabannaluya Yesu, “Mwalimu, nnwawa yu' aboyolilwe bwalipu. <verse eid="JHN 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5" />Musalya yitu Musa aatulagi panga nnwawa kati yu' aku'mbu'lwe maliwe. Bai, wenga ubaya buli?” <verse eid="JHN 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6" />Banalwiye liswali li', kwa kumpi'ndi'ka li'nga bapate kitumbu sa kunsitakya. Lakini Yesu ngayinama pai' no andika mubwi' kwa lukonji lwake. <verse eid="JHN 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7" />Pabaayendeli kunnaluya, Yesu ngakatuka, ngaabakia, “Mundu ywangali sambi kasinu, atumbwe kunku'mbwa liwe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8" />Bu'kapo ngayinama kai' no andika mubwi'. <verse eid="JHN 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9" />Pabayu'wine nyo, ngabatumbwa bu'ka yumo yumo baalongoli agoi, Yesu aaigile kisake na yu'lu' nnwawa aayi'mi papalu'palu'. <verse eid="JHN 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10" />Yesu paakatwike ngannaluya yu'lu' nnwawa, “Nnwawa, bai kwaku' balu' bandu babaakusitakile? Buli, ntu'pu' ata yumo ywakusenwile?” <verse eid="JHN 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11" />Yu'lu' nnwawa ngannyangwa, “Bwana, ntu'pu' ata yumo!” Yesu ngammakia, “Ata nenga nikusenwali. Uyende bai, ila bu'ka nambi'yambi' kaneupange sambi kai'.”<verse eid="JHN 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nga bweya wa dunia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12" />Yesu paalongei nabo bandu kai', aatikwabakia, “Nenga nga na bweya wa padunia. Ywanikota nenga ayendali mulubi'ndu' katu, ila alu'a ba na bweya wa kumpeya ukoto.”<verse eid="JHN 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13" />Bai, Mafalisayo ngabammakia, “Ukong'ondeli wako uyi'ki'ti'lwali, kwa mwanjaa wikong'ondelya wamwene.” <verse eid="JHN 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Ata mana kaniikong'ondelya namwene, ukong'ondeli wangu' ngawa kakape kwa mwanjaa nitangite kwaniumi na kwaniyenda. Lakini mwenga mutangiteli kwaniumi wala kwaniyenda. <verse eid="JHN 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15" />Mwenga muukumu kwo koleya makowe ga bandu, lakini nenga nimuukumuli mundu. <verse eid="JHN 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16" />Lakini ata mana nipiyite ukumu, ukumu kwangu' kwa kakape kwa mwanjaa nenga niukumuli kisangu' ila na Tati' babanitumike babile pamope nanenga. <verse eid="JHN 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17" />Iandikilwe musalya yinu panga ukong'ondeli wa bandu abi'li' ngawa kakape. <verse eid="JHN 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18" />Nenga niikong'ondelya namwene, nabembe Tati' babanitumike bendanikong'ondelya nyinyonyo.” <verse eid="JHN 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19" />Apo ngabannaluya, “Tati' bako bai kwaku'?” Yesu ngaayangwa, “Mwenga munitangiteli nenga wala mwatangiteli Tati' bangu'. Ikapanga munitangite nenga, mulu'e kwatanga na Tati' bangu'.”<verse eid="JHN 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20" />Yesu aagalongei mayi'gi'yo go papipi na lisanduku lya mabi'ko, paabile kayi'gana munyumba ya Nnu'ngu'. Lakini ntu'pu' mundu ywammoywile, kwa mwanjaa saa yake yaai inaikali.<verse eid="JHN 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaniyenda mwenga mukombwali ika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21" />Yesu ngaabakia kai', “Nendabu'ka, mwenga mwaalu'a nipala, lakini mwalu'a waa mumasambi ginu. Kwaniyenda nenga, mwenga mukombwali ika.” <verse eid="JHN 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22" />Bai, alongosi ba Kiyahudi ngababaya, “Ywembe abaya panga kwayenda twenga tukombwali ika, buli, ayenda kwibulaga?” <verse eid="JHN 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Mwenga muuma paapanopano pai', nenga niuma kunani. Mwenga mwa ba padunia yi'no ila nenga na ywa padunia yi'no lili. <verse eid="JHN 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24" />Kwa nyo nammakiangite panga mwalu'a waa mumasambi ginu. Mana mukotwike u'bi'lya panga nenga nga naywembe, mwalu'a waa mumasambi ginu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25" />Nabembe ngabannaluya, “Wenga wa nyai?” Yesu ngaayangwa, “Nenga nga yu'lu' ywanammakiangite bu'ka patumbu! <verse eid="JHN 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26" />Nibile na makowe gambone ga kummakia na ga kumuukumu mwenga, lakini yu'lu' ywanitumike nga ywa kakape, nanenga niibakia dunia makowe galu' ganigayu'wine bu'ka kasake.”<verse eid="JHN 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27" />Baatangiteli panga Yesu aabile kaalongelya Tati' bake. <verse eid="JHN 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28" />Bai, Yesu ngaabakia, “Bu'ka pamwantu'ndu'bi'ya Mwana wa Mundu kunani, ngapamwatanga panga nenga nga naywembe no panga nipangali sosoti nenga namwene, ila nilongela galu' gabaniyi'ganiye Tati' bai. <verse eid="JHN 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29" />Yu'lu' ywanitumike ai pamope nanenga. Ananilekali, kwa mwanjaa masu'ba goti nipanga gagannogelelya ywembe.” <verse eid="JHN 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30" />Paabile kalongela go, bandu baingi ngabamwu'bi'lya.<verse eid="JHN 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukakape ulu'a kumpeya uulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31" />Bai, Yesu ngaabakia balu' Ayahudi babaamwu'bi'lile, “Mana mwagakoleya mayi'gano gangu', kakape mwapanga mwabanamasi' bangu'. <verse eid="JHN 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32" />Apo, ngaapo mwaitanga kweli, nayembe kweli ngayayalu'a kumpanga mube ulu.” <verse eid="JHN 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33" />Bembe ngabannyangwa, “Twenga twa lubelekwo lwa Bulaimu, na tunapangali twaabanda kwa mundu ywoywoti katu, ukombwabuli baya, ‘Mulu'a ba ulu?’” <verse eid="JHN 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Kakape nimmakianga, kila mundu ywapanga sambi nga mmanda wa sambi. <verse eid="JHN 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35" />Masu'ba goti, mmanda abalangilwali mukipi'nga sa alongo ba pakaya, lakini mwana abalangilwa mualongo ba pakaya masu'ba goti. <verse eid="JHN 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36" />Mwanjaa, Mwana mana ampei uulu, kakape mwaalu'a panga ulu. <verse eid="JHN 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37" />Ndangite panga mwenga mwa lubelekwo lwa Bulaimu. Ata nyo, mupala kunibulaga kwa mwanjaa mugayi'ki'tyali mayi'gi'yo gangu'. <verse eid="JHN 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38" />Nenga nigabaya galu' ganaagabweni kwa Tati' bangu', na mwenga mugapanga galu' gamugayu'wine bu'ka kwa tati' binu.”<verse eid="JHN 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39" />Bembe ngabannyangwa, “Twenga twa bana ba Bulaimu!” Yesu ngaabakia, “Ikapangage mwabana ba Bulaimu, mulu'e panga kati mwaapangage Bulaimu. <verse eid="JHN 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40" />Nenga nimmakiyangite kweli yanaaiyu'wine kwa Nnu'ngu', ata nyo mwenga mupala kunibulaga. Bulaimu aapangiteli nyo! <verse eid="JHN 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41" />Mwenga mupanga makowe gagalu'galu' gabapanga tati' binu.” Bembe ngabammakia, “Twenga twabana ba makowe ga mwiloli, tubile na Tati' bamo, naywembe nga Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="JHN 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Ikapangage Nnu'ngu' nga Tati' binu, mulu'e kunipenda nenga, kwa mwanjaa nenga naaumi kwa Nnu'ngu', na nambi'yambi' nibile pano. Niisili kwa kitumbu sangu' namwene, ila kwa ywembe ywanitumike. <verse eid="JHN 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43" />Mwanjaa namani mugaomongwa ganimmakia? Kwa mwanjaa mukana kugayu'wa mayi'gi'yo gangu'. <verse eid="JHN 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44" />Mwenga nga mwabana ba Ibilisi, na mupala panga kati mwabapala tati' binu. Ywembe aai mmulagi bu'ka kwai'mbu', ntu'pu' ukakape kwa mwanjaa ukakape ubileli nkati yake. Kila palongela ubu'su', alongela bu'kana na kibelekwe sake, mwanjaa ywembe mmu'su' na tati' wa ubu'su'. <verse eid="JHN 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45" />Nenga nilongela kakape, na kwa nyo mwenga muniu'bi'lyali. <verse eid="JHN 8:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46" />Buli, ywaku' kasinu ywawesa kunikong'ondelya panga nenga nibile na sambi? Na mana kanimmakia ga kakape, kwa ki'li' mukotoka kuniu'bi'lya? <verse eid="JHN 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47" />Ywaai ywa Nnu'ngu' api'kania mayi'gi'yo ga Nnu'ngu'. Lakini mwenga mupi'kaniali, kwa mwanjaa mwenga mwa bandu ba Nnu'ngu' lili.”<verse eid="JHN 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anabelekwali Bulaimu Yesu aabile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48" />Ayahudi ngabammakia, “Buli, twabaiteli panga kakape wenga ngawa Nsamalia, kai' ubile na moka?” <verse eid="JHN 8:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Nenga ntu'pu' moka. Naisimu Tati' bangu', lakini mwenga muniisimuli. <verse eid="JHN 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50" />Nenga niipalyali utukupu wangu' namwene, abile yumo mwene kuupala utukupu wo, naywembe nga mwene makakala go ukumu. <verse eid="JHN 8:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51" />Kakape nimmakianga, mundu ywagakoleya mayi'gi'yo gangu' aawali milele.” <verse eid="JHN 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52" />Bai, Ayahudi ngababaya, “Nambi'yambi' kakape tutangite panga ubile na moka! Bulaimu aatiwaa, nyonyo na alondoli baatiwaa, na wenga ubaya ati', ‘Ywaagakoleya mayi'gi'yo gangu', aawali milele!’ <verse eid="JHN 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53" />Buli, wipanga wa nku'lu' kuliko tati' bitu Bulaimu, ywaawile? Kai', ata alondoli nabembe baatiwaa. Wenga wipanga wanyai?” <verse eid="JHN 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Mana niikwi'yite namwene, utukupu wangu' kili'be lili. Tati' bangu' bamwabaya mwenga nga Nnu'ngu' winu, bembe ngabanikwi'ya nenga. <verse eid="JHN 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55" />Mwenga mwatangiteli, lakini nenga naatangite. Na mana nibaite naatangiteli, nilu'a panga na mmu'su'bu'su' kati mwenga. Nenga naatangite na nigakoleya mayi'gi'yo gabe. <verse eid="JHN 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56" />Tati' binu Bulaimu baatikwi'ndi'lya, kabau'bi'lya kulibona lisu'ba lyo isa kwangu', naywembe aatikulibona, nganapusika.” <verse eid="JHN 8:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57" />Bai, Ayahudi ngabammakia, “Wenga balo unaikiyali myaka amusini, ubaya buli umweni Bulaimu?” <verse eid="JHN 8:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Kakape nimmakianga, anabelekwali Bulaimu, ‘Nenga naabile<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:58 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu endabaya panga ywembe nga Nnu'ngu'.</char></note>.’” <verse eid="JHN 8:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59" />Apo ngabatondwa maliwe li'nga banku'mbwe, lakini Yesu ngayu'ba no pita panja ya nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="JHN 8:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu antepwa mundu ywabelekwi mbulibuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus healing blind man mud on eyes - WA03865" file="JesusHealingBlindMan_John9.1-7_1MudOnEyes_WA03865.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="9:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1" />Yesu paabile kapi'ta, aamweni mundu yumo, mbulibuli bu'ka belekwa. <verse eid="JHN 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2" />Bai, banamasi' ngabannaluya, “Mwalimu! Ywaku' ywapangite sambi, ayu' au abelei bake, mpaka abelekwe mbulibuli?” <verse eid="JHN 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Likowe li' lipitikeli kwa kitumbu sa sambi yake ywembe, wala sambi ya abelei bake, ila aabelekwi mbulibuli li'nga makakala ga Nnu'ngu' gabonekane kagapanga kasi nkati yake. <verse eid="JHN 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4" />Kubile balo muntwekati, tupalikwa yendelya panga lyengo lya yu'lu' ywanitumike, kwa mwanjaa kilo sendaisa so kotoka panga mundu lyengo. <verse eid="JHN 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5" />Panibaa mudunia, nenga nga nabweya wa padunia.” <verse eid="JHN 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6" />Bu'ka po baya go ngaunia mmata pai', na kuutepengaya ukando kwa mmata gake, ngaampakaya yu'lu' mbulibuli mminyo, <verse eid="JHN 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7" />ngammakia, “Uyende ukauluwe mulitanda lya Siloamu.” (Siloamu lombolya, “Ywatumilwe”). Bu'kapo aywo mbulibuli ngayenda uluwa no buyangana kalola.<verse eid="JHN 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8" />Bai, bapapipi yake na balu' boti babaabile kabammona apo patumbu panga aai nki'ba, kalu'balu'ba ngabatumbwa laluya, “Buli, ayu' nga yu'lu' nki'ba ywaabile katama no lu'balu'ba?” <verse eid="JHN 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9" />Bi'ngi' babe ngababaya, “Nga ywembe.” Bi'ngi' baabaite, “Lili! Ila endalandana nakwe.” Lakini yu'lu' ywaabile mbulibuli ngabaya, “Nga nenga!” <verse eid="JHN 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10" />Ngabannaluya, “Minyo gako gaatepulilwe kitiwi?” <verse eid="JHN 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11" />Naywembe ngaayangwa, “Yu'lu' mundu ywakemelwa Yesu, aatepengiye ukando, nganipakaya muminyo na kunibakia, ‘Uyende ukauluwe mulitanda lya Siloamu.’ Apo nenga nganiyenda uluwa, nganipata lola!” <verse eid="JHN 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12" />Ngabannaluya, “Aywo mundu we ai kwaku'?” Naywembe ngayangwa, “Ne ndangiteli!”<verse eid="JHN 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Upekeseni bu'kana no tepulwa kwa mbulibuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13" />Bu'kapo ngabampeleka aywo mundu ywaabile mbulibuli kwa Mafalisayo. <verse eid="JHN 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14" />Lisu'ba lyo Yesu lyaainyite utu'pi' na kummanjuya minyo mundu ywo, lyaai lisu'ba lya Sabato kwa Ayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15" />Bai, Mafalisayo ngabannaluya kai' mundu ywo, “Ukombwi buli lola?” Naywembe ngaabakia, “Aanipakiye utu'pi' mminyo, nanenga nganiuluwa na nambi'yambi' nendalola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16" />Mafalisayo bi'ngi' ngababaya, “Mundu yu' abu'ili kwa Nnu'ngu', kwa mwanjaa akamwali salya ya lisu'ba lya Sabato ya Ayahudi.” Lakini bi'ngi' ngababaya, “Mundu mwene sambi akombwabuli panga myasu kati yi'?” Ngakubaa na ntau nkati yabe. <verse eid="JHN 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17" />Kwa nyo ngabannaluya kai' yu'lu' ywaai mbulibuli, “Wenga nga wautepulilwe minyo, ubaya buli kwa mundu ywo?” Ngaayangwa, “Ywembe nga nnondoli ywa Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="JHN 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18" />Lakini api'ndo ba Ayahudi baau'bi'lili panga mundu ywo aai mbulibuli no pata lola mpaka pabaakemike abelei bake, <verse eid="JHN 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19" />ngabaalaluya, “Buli, ayu' nga mwana winu ywamubaya aabelekwi mbulibuli? Tumbwe akombwibuli lola?” <verse eid="JHN 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20" />Abelei bake ngabayangwa, “Tutangite panga ayu' nga mwana witu, na aabelekwi mbulibuli. <verse eid="JHN 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21" />Lakini apatike buli lola, tutangiteli, wala ywaantepwile minyo gake tuntangiteli. Munnaluye mwene, ywembe mundu mpi'ndo, endakombwa kwiawanikia.” <verse eid="JHN 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22" />Abelei bake baabaite nyo kwa mwanjaa baayogopage api'ndo ba Kiyahudi, bembe bayi'ki'tyanie panga mundu ywoywoti ywaayi'ki'tya panga Yesu nga Kilisitu alu'a bi'ngi'lwa munyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23" />Nga kitumbu sa abelei bake baya, “Ywembe mundu mpi'ndo, munnaluye mwene.”<verse eid="JHN 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24" />Bai, api'ndo ba Kiyahudi bankemite kai' yu'lu' ywaabile mbulibuli ngabammakia, “Kakape baya nnu'ngi' ya Nnu'ngu'! Twenga tutangite panga mundu yu' ywakutepwile mwene sambi.” <verse eid="JHN 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25" />Ywembe ngayangwa, “Nenga ndangiteli panga ywembe mwene sambi. Lakini kili'be simo sanitangite, naai na mbulibuli na nambi'yambi' nendalola.” <verse eid="JHN 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26" />Bai, ngabannaluya, “Aakupangi ki'li'? Akutepwi buli minyo gako?” <verse eid="JHN 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27" />Aywo mundu ngaayangwa, “Nengite nimmakiangite, mwenga munipi'kanili, kwa ki'li' mupala pi'kania kai'? Buli, na mwenga mupala ba mwabanamasi' bake?” <verse eid="JHN 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28" />Lakini bembe ngabampwi'wa kababaya, “Wenga ngawa mwanamasi' wake, twenga twa banamasi' ba Musa. <verse eid="JHN 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29" />Twenga tutangite panga Nnu'ngu' aalongei na Musa, lakini mundu yu' tutangiteli kwauma!” <verse eid="JHN 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30" />Naywembe ngaayangwa, “Ali' likowe lyo sangala, mwenga mutangiteli kwauma, lakini nenga anitepwile minyo gangu'. <verse eid="JHN 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31" />Tutangite panga Nnu'ngu' aapi'kaniali bandu bene sambi, ila api'kania boti babankilikitya na kunnyu'wa. <verse eid="JHN 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32" />Bu'ka umbilwa dunia, tunayu'wali panga kubile na mundu ywoywoti ywakombwa kuntepwa mundu ywaai mbulibuli bu'ka belekwa kwake. <verse eid="JHN 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33" />Kenda mundu yu' aumali kwa Nnu'ngu', apelekombwali panga likowe lyolyoti!” <verse eid="JHN 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34" />Bembe ngabannyangwa, “Wenga wa mwene sambi bu'ka belekwa kwako! Ukombwabuli kutuyi'gana twenga?” Bai, ngabammi'nga munyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu'. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus healing blind man, thrown out - WA03866" file="JesusHealingBlindMan_John9.34_2ThrownOut_WA03866.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="9:34" /><verse eid="JHN 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umbulibuli wa loo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35" />Yesu paayu'wine panga bammi'ngite munyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' yu'lu' ywaabile mbulibuli, ngankolya na kunnaluya, “Buli wenga wendakumwu'bi'lya Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'?” <verse eid="JHN 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36" />Yu'lu' mundu ngayangwa, “Bwana, nibakia ywembe nga nyai, li'nga nipate kumwu'bi'lya.” <verse eid="JHN 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37" />Yesu ngammakia, “Umweni, na nga ywaulongela nakwe nambi'yambi'.” <verse eid="JHN 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38" />Bai, yu'lu' mundu ngabaya, “Bwana, nendau'bi'lya!” Ngankilikitya.<verse eid="JHN 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39" />Yesu ngabaya, “Nenga niisi mudunia li'nga ukumu ipate pangika, ilombolya balu' babakotoka lola bapate lola na babalola babe kimbulibuli.” <verse eid="JHN 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40" />Mafalisayo bi'ngi' babaabile pamope naywembe pabaayu'wine mayi'gi'yo go, ngabannaluya, “Buli, na twenga kai' twakimbulibuli?” <verse eid="JHN 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Mukapangage mwa kimbulibuli, mulu'e bali musambi, lakini nambi'yambi' mwenga mubaya, ‘Twenga twendalola,’ apo ilaya panga balo mubile na sambi.”<verse eid="JHN 9:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10" />
  <para style="s">Nsungi nnogau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Shepherd carrying lamb - BK00007" file="ShepherdCarryingLamb_BK00007.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="10:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1" />“Kakape nimmakia, ywoywoti yu'lu' ywaayingya mukyu'ngu'lu' sa ngondolo pangali pi'tya muniango, lakini ayingya kwo pekenya pandu pi'ngi', aywo mmwi na mpokonyoli. <verse eid="JHN 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2" />Lakini ywayingya kwo pi'tya muniango, aywo nga nsungi ywa ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3" />Nni'ndi'li ywa paniango wa kyu'ngu'lu' ngaywannyu'gu'lya, na ngondolo bendaliyu'wa lilobe lyake. Ywembe aakema ngondolo bake kwa maina gabe, na kwapikia panja. <verse eid="JHN 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4" />Mana ayomwile kwapikia panja boti, alongolya nnu'ngi' nabembe bendakunki'ngama, kwa mwanjaa balitangite lilobe lyake. <verse eid="JHN 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5" />Ngondolo banki'ngamali nng'eni, ila balu'a kuntila kwa mwanjaa balitangiteli lilobe lyake.” <verse eid="JHN 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6" />Yesu aabakiye lukongo lu'no, lakini bembe baakwipwili sapalage kwabakia.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 10:6">Yesu nsungi nnogau</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 10:6">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Sheepfold pen - LB00014" file="Sheepfold-Pen_Micah2.12_LB00014.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="10:6" /> <verse eid="JHN 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7" />Bai, Yesu ngabaya kai', “Kakape nimmakianga, nenga nga na nniango wa ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8" />Balu' bi'ngi' boti babaaisi nsu'gu' yangu' baabile baii na apokonyoli, lakini ngondolo baapi'kanili. <verse eid="JHN 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9" />Nenga nga na niango, ywaayingya kwo pi'tya kasangu' akosopolelwa, alu'a yingya no pita naywembe alu'a pata kilyo. <verse eid="JHN 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10" />Mmwi endaisa li'nga yiba, bulaga no alabiya. Nenga niisi li'nga bandu bapate ukoto, kai' babe nawo wambone.<verse eid="JHN 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11" />“Nenga na nsungi nnogau. Nsungi nnogau aupiya bwu'mi wake kwa kitumbu sa ngondolo bake. <verse eid="JHN 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12" />Mundu ywo li'pi'lwa ywembe ngondolo mali yake lili na nsungi lili, pammona pu'mbe kaisa, endatila na kwaleka ngondolo kababoyolwa no sengemwanika. <verse eid="JHN 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13" />Ywembe endatila na abi'kyali kiya ngondolo, kwa mwanjaa ywembe mundu ywo li'pi'lwa bai. <verse eid="JHN 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14" />Nenga na nsungi nnogau. Naatangite ngondolo bangu', na ngondolo bangu' banitangite, <verse eid="JHN 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15" />kati mu'lu' Tati' mwabanitangite, nanenga mwanaatangite Tati'. Nenga niupiya bwu'mi wangu' kwa kitumbu sa ngondolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16" />Kai' nibile na ngondolo bi'ngi', bembe baabileli mukyu'ngu'lu' si'no, ipalikwa kwaleta kai', nabembe balu'a yu'wa lilobe lyangu', na kwalu'a baa na kipi'nga simo na nsungi yumo.<verse eid="JHN 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17" />“Ngamo Tati' banipenda, kwa mwanjaa niupiya bwu'mi wangu' li'nga niupoki kai'. <verse eid="JHN 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18" />Ntu'pu' mundu ywanipokonywa bwu'mi wangu', nenga niupiya kwo penda namwene. Nibile na makakala ga kuupiya na makakala ga kuutola kai'. Amo ngamwabaniamulise Tati' nipange.”<verse eid="JHN 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19" />Bu'kana na mayi'gi'yo ga, ngakupitya kai' kotoka yi'ki'tyana mukipi'nga sa Ayahudi. <verse eid="JHN 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20" />Bi'ngi' babe ngababaya, “Aina moka, kai' aina lilalu'! Mwanjaa namani kumpi'kania?” <verse eid="JHN 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21" />Bi'ngi' ngababaya, “Aga mayi'gi'yo ga mundu mwene moka lili. Buli, moka gendakombwa kuntepwa minyo mbulibuli?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 10:21">Yesu akanilwa na Ayahudi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 10:21">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Priests challenge Jesus in Temple - CN01757" file="PriestsChallengeJesusInTemple_CN01757.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="10:21" /> <verse eid="JHN 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22" />Akwo ku Yelusalemu kwaai na si'li'ku'si'li'ku' yo ku'mbu'kya bi'ki'lwa wakupu nyumba ya Nnu'ngu'. Nsimu wo waai wa kipepwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23" />Naywembe Yesu aai katyanga mulubanja lwa luwa lwa Nyumba ya Nnu'ngu', pandu papakemelwa Sega sa Selemani. <verse eid="JHN 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24" />Bai, Ayahudi ngabanti'li'ta na kunnaluya, “Upala kutuleka mukyukala mpaka pakubawi? Manaitei wenga nga wa Kilisitu, bai utubakiye mpu'la.” <verse eid="JHN 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Nimmakiangite, lakini muu'bi'lyali. Mengo ganigapanga nenga kwa lina lya Tati' bangu' gendanikong'ondelya. <verse eid="JHN 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26" />Lakini mwenga muu'bi'lyali kwa mwanjaa mwenga mwangondolo bangu' li. <verse eid="JHN 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27" />Ngondolo bangu' baliyu'wa lilobe lyangu', nanenga naatangite, nabembe bendanibi'ngi'ya. <verse eid="JHN 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28" />Nenga naapeya ukoto wangayomoka, nabembe baaobali milele, kai' ntu'pu' mundu ywaakombwa kwabu'ya mumaboko gangu'. <verse eid="JHN 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29" />Tati' bangu' babaanipei ngondolo ba, nga aku'lu' kulikoni boti, kai' ntu'pu' ywaakombwa kwabu'ya mumaboko ga Tati' bangu'. <verse eid="JHN 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30" />Nenga na Tati' twabamo.”<verse eid="JHN 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31" />Bai, Ayahudi ngabatondwa kai' maliwe li'nga banku'mbwe. <verse eid="JHN 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32" />Lakini Yesu ngaabakia kai', “Ninnayangite mengo gambone manogau bu'ka kwa Tati'. Lyengo lyaku' mumengo go, lyalipala kumpanga muniku'mbwe maliwe?” <verse eid="JHN 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33" />Ayahudi ngabannyangwa, “Tukuku'mbwa maliwe kwenda kwa kitumbu sa mengo manogau lili, ila kwa kitumbu sa kunkupulu Nnu'ngu'! Kwa mwanjaa wipanga wa Nnu'ngu' naapo wenga wa mundu bai.” <verse eid="JHN 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Buli, inaandikilwali musalya yinu panga, <char style="qt">‘Nenga nibaite, mwenga nga mwakinnu'ngu'</char>?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35" />Nnu'ngu' aakemite kinnu'ngu' balu' babaapeyilwe mayi'gi'yo gake, na twenga tutangite panga Maandiko Mapeleteu gabaya kakape, gaati'kwanikali. <verse eid="JHN 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36" />Mukombwabuli baya, ‘Endakupulu,’ yu'lu' ywaabi'kilwe wakupu na Tati' no tumilwa mudunia, ati' kwa mwanjaa naabaite, ‘Nenga na Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'?’ <verse eid="JHN 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37" />Manaitei nipangali lyengo lya Tati' bangu', bai kanemuniu'bi'li, <verse eid="JHN 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38" />lakini manaitei muniu'bi'lyali, male muu'bi'li alyo lyengo lyanipanga, mupate tanga panga kakape Tati' bai nkati yangu' na nenga ni nkati yabe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39" />Ngabapaya kai' kummoywa lakini ngabannema mumaboko gabe.<verse eid="JHN 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40" />Yesu aayi'i kai' kwiyi' ya libi'ndi' lya Yordani, pandu po kwai'mbu' Yoani aabatisage bandu, ngatama kwo. <verse eid="JHN 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41" />Bandu baingi ngabannyendelya kababaya, “Yoani aapangiteli myasu yoyoti. Lakini galu' goti gaabaite Yoani kwa mundu yu', kakape ngagembe.” <verse eid="JHN 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42" />Pandu po bandu baingi ngabamwu'bi'lya Yesu.<verse eid="JHN 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11" />
  <para style="s">Kiwo sa Lasali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1" />Bai, kwai na mundu yumo ywakemelwage Lasali aai ntamwe. Aywo atamage kukilambo sa Betania na alu'mbu'be Malia na Malita. <verse eid="JHN 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2" />Malia nga yu'lu' ywaampakiye Bwana mauta mumagu'lu' na kumponwa kwa nywili yake. <verse eid="JHN 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3" />Bai, abo akinaalu'mbu'be ngabapeleka abali kwa Yesu, “Bwana, yu'lu' mbwigalyo ywaumpendile endaminya.”<verse eid="JHN 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4" />Yesu paayu'wine nyo ngabaya, “Utamwe wo wakumpanga awee lili, ila kwa kitumbu sa kunkwi'ya Nnu'ngu'. Endaminya li'nga kwa ndi'la yo, Mwana wa Nnu'ngu' akwi'yi'lwe.”<verse eid="JHN 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5" />Yesu aapendi Malita, Malia na Lasali nnuna wabe. <verse eid="JHN 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6" />Pamope no yu'wa panga Lasali aai ntamwe, lakini Yesu aayendeli tama pandu po kwa masu'ba gabi'li'. <verse eid="JHN 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7" />Bu'kapo ngaabakia banamasi' bake, “Tuki'li'bu'ki kai' ku Yudea.” <verse eid="JHN 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8" />Banamasi' bake ngabammakia, “Mwalimu, ganapi'tali masu'ba gambone bu'ka pa Ayahudi pabapalage kukuku'mbwa maliwe, nambi'yambi' upala yenda kai'?” <verse eid="JHN 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Kubile na masaa ku'mi na gabi'li' ga muntwekati mulisu'ba limo. Bai, mundu mana atyangite muntwekati aawesali ku'bala kwa mwanjaa aubona bweya wa padunia yi'no. <verse eid="JHN 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10" />Lakini mundu mana atyangite kilo, alu'a ku'bala kwa mwanjaa ntu'pu' bweya nkati yake.” <verse eid="JHN 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11" />Yesu paayomwi longela ago, ngaabakia, “Mbwiga litu Lasali atigonja, lakini nenga niyenda kunnyumuya.” <verse eid="JHN 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12" />Banamasi' bake ngabammakia, “Bwana, manaitei agonjike lugono, bai alu'a yu'yu'ki'lwa.” <verse eid="JHN 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13" />Bembe bakitage Yesu aabile kannongelya Lasali panga agonjike lugono, lakini aabile kalongelya kiwo sa Lasali. <verse eid="JHN 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14" />Bai, Yesu ngaabakia mpu'la, “Lasali ayomwike, <verse eid="JHN 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15" />lakini ninapusika panga naabileli kwo, li'nga muu'bi'li. Aya, tubu'ke kasake.” <verse eid="JHN 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16" />Toma (ywakemelwage Mapaga) ngaabakia banamasi' aine, “Na twenga tuyende tukawee pamope na Yesu!”<verse eid="JHN 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nga uyu'ki na ukoto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17" />Yesu paaikite kwo, gaai gapite masu'ba nsese bu'ka po sikilwa kwa Lasali. <verse eid="JHN 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18" />Kilambo sa Betania saai kilometa itatu bu'ka ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19" />Ayahudi bambone baaisi kwa Malita na Malia, li'nga kwali'yali'ya kwo wi'li'kwa na mwasa wabe.<verse eid="JHN 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20" />Bai, Malita paayu'wine panga Yesu endaisa, ngankwi'ndi'lya na kumpokya, lakini Malia aaigali nnyumba. <verse eid="JHN 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21" />Malita ngammakia Yesu, “Bwana, ukabage pano, mwasangu' alu'e waali! <verse eid="JHN 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22" />Lakini ata nambi'yambi' ndangite panga sosoti saulu'a kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu', alu'a kupeya.” <verse eid="JHN 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23" />Yesu ngammakia, “Mwasago alu'a yu'ka.” <verse eid="JHN 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24" />Malita ngannyangwa, “Ndangite panga aalu'a yu'ka lisu'ba lya kuundi'la, pabaayu'ka bandu boti.” <verse eid="JHN 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25" />Yesu ngammakia, “Nenga nga na uyu'ki na ukoto. Ywaniu'bi'lya nenga ata mana awile, alu'a lama, <verse eid="JHN 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26" />na kila ywatama nkati yangu' na kuniu'bi'lya katu awaali. Buli, wendau'bi'lya ago?” <verse eid="JHN 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27" />Malita ngammakia, “Elo Bwana! Nenga nendau'bi'lya panga wenga nga wa Kilisitu, Mwana wa Nnu'ngu', yu'lu' ywaaisa padunia.”<verse eid="JHN 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ali'la moli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28" />Bu'ka po baya go, Malita aayi'i kunkema Malia nku'we, pandu pakisake na kummakia, “Mwalimu abile pano endakukema.” <verse eid="JHN 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29" />Naywembe paayu'wine nyo, popopo ngakatuka na kunnyendelya Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30" />Yesu aabile anayingyali mukilambo, ila aabile balo papalu'palu' paakwi'ndi'lilwe na Malita. <verse eid="JHN 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31" />Bai, Ayahudi babaabile panyumba pamope na Malia kabanni'yali'ya, pabamweni akatwike no pitya panja kiyu'ngu'ya, ngabanki'ngama. Bakitage panga apala yenda lombola ku'lu' kulisiko.<verse eid="JHN 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32" />Bai, Malia paaikite pandu palu' Yesu paabile na kummona, aakilikite pai' na kummakia, “Bwana, ukabage pano, mwasangu' apewaali!” <verse eid="JHN 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33" />Yesu paamweni Malia kali'la, na balu' Ayahudi babaaisi pamope nakwe kabali'la kai', lwampatike lwu'ngu' pamwoyo no usunika. <verse eid="JHN 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34" />Bu'kapo ngaalaluya, “Mwammi'i kwaku'?” Ngabammakia, “Bwana, so linge.” <verse eid="JHN 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35" />Yesu aali'i moli. <verse eid="JHN 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36" />Bai, Ayahudi ngababaya, “Mulinge mu'lu' mwaampendile!” <verse eid="JHN 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37" />Lakini bi'ngi' babe ngababaya, “Buli, ayu' nga ywantepwile minyo yu'lu' mbulibuli, aakotwike buli kumpanga Lasali kaneawe?”<verse eid="JHN 11:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu annyu'ya Lasali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38" />Bai, Yesu abile ausunike kai' pamwoyo wake, ngaika palipango lyo sikya lyaliwi'ki'lilwe na liwe. <verse eid="JHN 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39" />Yesu ngabaya, “Mulibu'ye alyo liwe.” Malita, ywaabile nnu'mbowe malemu, ngammakia, “Bwana, atumbwile nunga, kwa mwanjaa li'no lisu'ba lyene nsese bu'ka pasikilwe!” <verse eid="JHN 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40" />Yesu ngammakia, “Buli, nakubakiyeli panga mana uu'bi'lile, ulu'a kuubona utukupu wa Nnu'ngu'?” <verse eid="JHN 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41" />Bai, ngabalibu'ya li'lu' liwe. Yesu ngatu'ndu'bi'ya minyo gake kunani, kabaya, “Tati', nendakunsukulu kwa mwanjaa mwenga mwendanipi'kania. <verse eid="JHN 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42" />Masu'ba goti ndangite panga mwendanipi'kania. Lakini nilongei aga goti kwa kitumbu sa bandu bababile pano li'nga nabembe bau'bi'li panga mwenga nga mwamunitumike.” <figure style="fig" alt="Lazarus resurrection" file="CN01768C.TIF" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="11:42" /> <verse eid="JHN 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43" />Paayomwi longela go, ngakema kwa lilobe liku'lu', “Lasali, upite panja!” <verse eid="JHN 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44" />Yu'lu' ywaai awile ngapitya panja, ku'no atabilwe sanda mmagu'lu' na mmoko, na kuminyo yake kuwi'ki'lilwe. Yesu ngaabakia, “Mumundwe, munneke ayende.”<verse eid="JHN 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ndi'la ya kummulaga Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat 26:1-5</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mal 14:1-2</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45" />Bai, Ayahudi bambone babaaisi kwa Malia, pabagabweni galu' gaagapangite Yesu, ngabamwu'bi'lya. <verse eid="JHN 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46" />Lakini bi'ngi' babe ngabayenda kwa Mafalisayo kwabakia likowe lyo lyaapangite Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47" /><figure style="fig" alt="Jewish priest" file="NT-18 Priest.tif" size="col" ref="11:47">Mpi'ndo ywa dini ya Kiyahudi</figure>Kwa nyo Api'ndo ba dini na Mafalisayo ngabakema kitamo sa Balasa Liku'lu' lya Ayahudi, ngababaya, “Tupange buli? Mundu yu' alaya myasu yambone. <verse eid="JHN 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48" />Mana tunnei bai, bandu boti bapalakumwu'bi'lya, na Aroma baalu'a isa alabiya nyumba ya Nnu'ngu' witu na nni'ma witu!” <verse eid="JHN 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49" />Apo yumo ywabe ywakemelwa Kayafa, ywembe aai mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini mwaka wo, ngaabakia, “Mwenga mutangiteli kili'be sosoti! <verse eid="JHN 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50" />Buli, mwibonali kwinu panga male mundu yumo awee paali pa bandu, kulikoni nni'ma woti ulangamiswe?” <verse eid="JHN 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51" />Ywembe aalongei nyo kwo penda mwene lili, ila kwa mwanjaa aai mpi'ndo ywa dini mwaka wo, aatilondwa panga Yesu alu'a waa paali pa bandu ba nni'ma wake, <verse eid="JHN 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52" />kai', kiwo sake kwa kitumbu sa abo baili, ila li'nga kwalu'mbania pamope bana ba Nnu'ngu' babasengemwanike.<verse eid="JHN 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53" />Bai, tumbulya lisu'ba lyo alongosi ba Kiyahudi ngabapala ndi'la ya kummulaga Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54" />Kwa nyo Yesu atyangiteli pabandu ba Kiyahudi, ila aabu'i po yenda papipi na lupu'ngu'ti', mukilambo sakikemelwa Eflaimu. Ngatama kwo pamope na banamasi' bake. <verse eid="JHN 11:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55" />Si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Pasika kwa Ayahudi yaai kaiegelya, na bandu bambone baayi'i ku Yelusalemu li'nga bakaipeleteye kwa Pasika yo. <verse eid="JHN 11:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56" />Bai, bandu ngababa kabampala Yesu. Nabembe pabakongolekine pandu pamo munyumba ya Nnu'ngu', ngabalaluyana, “Muwasa buli? Ibonekana panga aisali katu musi'li'ku'si'ku' au lili?” <verse eid="JHN 11:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57" />Api'ndo ba dini na Mafalisayo baapiyite amuli panga mundu mana atangite kwabile Yesu, alete abali li'nga bapate kummoywa.<verse eid="JHN 11:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu apakayilwa mauta ganannungya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Woman anointing Jesus Feet - CN01778" file="WomanAnointingJesus'FeetWithPerfume_CN01778.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="12:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1" />Masu'ba sita kaiegelya Pasika, Yesu aayi'i Betania kwaatamage Lasali, yu'lu' ywaayu'yilwe na Yesu bu'ka kuuwi'li. <verse eid="JHN 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2" />Akwo ngabankemya kilyo sa kitamwiyo, naywembe Malita aabile kaabi'kya wiso. Lasali aabile yumo ywa balu' babaabile pamesa pamope na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3" />Bai, Malia ngatola lisinda lya lita ya mauta ganannungya ga naldo ga bei ngu'lu', ngampakaya Yesu mmagu'lu' na kugaponwa kwa nywili yake. Nyumba yoti ngaitwi'lya lumba lunannungya. <verse eid="JHN 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4" />Bai, Yuda Isikalioti, yumo ywa banamasi' ba Yesu ywembe ngaywaalu'a kunsongya, ngabaya, <verse eid="JHN 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5" />“Kwa mwanjaa namani mauta ganannungya ga gasomwa pi'mi'yi'lwa kwa mbanje ya dinali mya itatu, na mbanje yo peyelwa aki'ba?” <verse eid="JHN 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6" />Aabaite nyo, kwenda aabi'ki kiya aki'ba li, ila kwa mwanjaa aabile mmi'ki wa mabi'ko na aai mmwi, na aitolyage mali bu'ka mumabi'ko. <verse eid="JHN 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7" />Lakini Yesu ngabaya, “Munneke kanemunsuluye ayu' mau', kwa mwanjaa aagabi'kite mauta kwa lisu'ba lyo sikilwa kwangu'. <verse eid="JHN 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8" />Aki'ba mubile nabo masu'ba goti, lakini mwaalu'a baali nanenga masu'ba goti.”<verse eid="JHN 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Panga ndi'la ya kummulaga Lasali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9" />Ayahudi bambone pabaayu'wine panga Yesu aai ku Betania, baaikite kwo kwenda kummona Yesu baili, ila li'nga kummona Lasali ywaayu'yilwe bu'ka kuuwi'li. <verse eid="JHN 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10" />Api'ndo aku'lu' ba dini ngabaamwa kummulaga Lasali kai', <verse eid="JHN 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11" />kwa kitumbu sa Lasali Ayahudi bi'ngi' baamwu'bi'li Yesu, paali pa kwau'bi'lya alongosi ba dini yabe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 12:11">Yesu ayingya ku Yelusalemu kwo napusika</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 12:11">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat 21:1-11</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Mal 11:1-11</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19:28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 12:11">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Triumphal entry - Dunham DN00487" file="TriumphalEntry_DN00487.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Darwin Dunham © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="12:11" /> <verse eid="JHN 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12" />Pammalau' yake kipi'nga kiku'lu' sa bandu babaaisi kusi'li'ku'si'li'ku' baayu'wine panga Yesu ai mundi'la isa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13" />Ngabatola ndambi' ya mitende, pita panja yenda kunkwi'ndi'lya, ngabau'bu'ya malobe kababaya, <char style="qt">“Nnu'ngu' alumbilwe! Ayaliwe aywo ywaisa kwa lina lya Bwana!</char> Ayaliwe nkulungwa wa ku Isilaili!” <verse eid="JHN 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14" />Yesu ngampata mwana mbu'nda yumo, ngau'bu'ka panani yake kati Maandiko mwagabaya, <verse eid="JHN 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15" /><char style="qt">“Kanemuyogope mwa ba kilambo sa Sayuni! Linguli, nkulungwa winu au'bwike mwana mbu'nda endaisa!”</char> <verse eid="JHN 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16" />Patumbu banamasi' bake baakwipwili makowe ga, lakini Yesu paakwi'yilwe, apo ngabaku'mbu'kya panga ago gaandikilwe kwa ywembe na aapangilwe ywembe.<verse eid="JHN 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17" />Kipi'nga sa bandu balu' babaai pamope na Yesu paankemite Lasali bu'ka mulisiko, na kunnyu'ya bu'ka kuuwi'li, baayendeli kunkong'ondelya. <verse eid="JHN 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18" />Kwa nyo kipi'nga sa bandu ngabankwi'ndi'lya, kwa mwanjaa boti baayu'wine panga Yesu ngaywapangite mwasu wo. <verse eid="JHN 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19" />Bai, Mafalisayo ngababakiana, “Mwendalola? Tukombwali panga sosoti! Mulinge, dunia yoti inki'ngama ywembe!”<verse eid="JHN 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bi'ngi' ba Agiliki bapala kummona Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20" />Kwaabile na Agiliki nsi'si' mwa balu' bandu babaayi'i Yelusalemu kilikita nsimu wa si'li'ku'si'li'ku'. <verse eid="JHN 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21" />Abo ngabannyendelya Pilipi, mwenekaya wa Betisaida mu Galilaya, ngabammakia, “Bwana, tulu'ba kummona Yesu.” <verse eid="JHN 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22" />Pilipi ngayenda kummakia Andelea, na boti abi'li' ngabayenda kummakia Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Saa yo kwi'yi'lwa Mwana wa Mundu iikite! <verse eid="JHN 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24" />Kakape nimmakianga, lupeke lwa ngano mana lunatu'mbu'kyali mubwi' no waa, lwaigala kati lupeke kisake bai. Lakini mana luwile lwaapiya mbeyu yambone. <verse eid="JHN 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25" />Ywapenda maisa gake, alu'a gaobeya, ywagasukya maisa gake mudunia yi'no, alu'a gali'ndi'la mpaka muukoto wangayomoka. <verse eid="JHN 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26" />Ywapala kunitumikia apalikwa aniki'ngame, li'nga popoti palu' panibile nenga, ngapaalu'a ba na ntumisi wangu'. Mundu mana kanitumikia, Tati' bangu' baalu'a kumwisimu.<verse eid="JHN 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alongelya kwa kiwo sake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27" />“Nambi'yambi' loo yangu' ibile na ntenyo, nilongele ki'li'? Buli, nibaye, ‘Mwa Tati' ninnu'ba munikosopoli bu'ka saa yi'no?’ Lili, kwa mwanjaa nga kitumbu saniisilile. <verse eid="JHN 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28" />Tati' mulikwi'ye lina linu.” Apo lilobe ngaliyu'wanika bu'ka kunani, “Nilikwi'yite, na naalu'a likwi'ya kai'.”<verse eid="JHN 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29" />Ipi'nga ya bandu yayaayi'mi po, yaayu'wine lilobe lyo, na bi'ngi' babe ngababaya, “Alyo lilobe lya njai,” Lakini bi'ngi' ngababaya, “Aalongei nakwe malaika!” <verse eid="JHN 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30" />Lakini Yesu ngaabakia, “Lilobe lyo linapityali kwa kitumbu sangu', ila kwa kitumbu sinu. <verse eid="JHN 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31" />Nambi'yambi' nga saa ya ukumu kwa dunia yi', na mpi'ndo ywa dunia yi' alu'a taikulilwa panja. <verse eid="JHN 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32" />Nenga panatu'ndu'bi'yi'lwa panani ya nni'ma, naalu'a kwauta bandu boti baise kasangu'.” <verse eid="JHN 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33" />Yesu aalongei nyo kalombolya kiwo saku' saalu'a waa.<verse eid="JHN 12:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34" />Bai, kipi'nga si'lu' ngakinnyangwa, “Twenga tubakiyilwa na salya yitu panga Kilisitu alu'a lama milele. Ukombwabuli baya Mwana wa Mundu apalikwa tundu'bi'yi'lwa? Aywo Mwana wa Mundu nga nyai?” <verse eid="JHN 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Balo pasene bweya ubile pamope na mwenga. Mutyangange mubile nawo awo bweya li'nga lubi'ndu' kanelumpatange, kwa mwanjaa ywatyanga mulubi'ndu' atangiteli kwayenda. <verse eid="JHN 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36" />Bai, nsimu wamubile mubweya wu'no, muu'bi'li bweya li'nga mupate panga mwabandu ba mubweya.” Bu'ka po longela mayi'gi'yo go, Yesu aatibu'ka no yu'ba kuutalu nabo.<verse eid="JHN 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bandu ntu'pu' imani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37" />Pamope no panga Yesu aapangite myasu yoti yi' nnu'ngi' yabe, bembe bammwu'bi'lili. <verse eid="JHN 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38" />Kwa nyo mayi'gi'yo gaabaite nnondoli ywa Nnu'ngu' Isaya ngagatimya, <char style="qt">“Bwana, nyai ywau'bi'li mayi'gi'yo gitu? Na uweso wa Bwana abakiyilwe nyai?” </char><verse eid="JHN 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39" />Kwa nyo bakombwili u'bi'lya, kwa mwanjaa Isaya aabaite kai',<verse eid="JHN 12:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40" />
    <char style="qt">“Nnu'ngu' aatu'lwi minyo gabe na kwipanga myoyo yabe ibe minonopau, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">kanebalole kwa minyo gabe na kanebatange kwa malango gabe, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">kai' kanebanigalambuki, abaya Bwana, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:40">
    <char style="qt">li'nga nakane kwatepwa.” </char><verse eid="JHN 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41" />Isaya aalongei mayi'gi'yo ga kwa mwanjaa aaubweni utukupu wa Yesu, ngabaya makowe gake.<verse eid="JHN 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42" />Ata nyo, api'ndo bambone ba Kiyahudi ngabamwu'bi'lya Yesu. Lakini kwa kitumbu sa Mafalisayo, bannyi'ki'tili pabandu kwo yogopa bi'ngi'lwa munyumba ya kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43" />Bembe baapendi lumbilwa na bandu kuliko lumbilwa na Nnu'ngu'.<verse eid="JHN 12:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aaisi kwikosopolya dunia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44" />Bu'kapo Yesu ngau'bu'ya lilobe lyake kabaya, “Mundu ywaniu'bi'lya, aniu'bi'lya nenga baili, ila amwu'bi'lya na yu'lu' ywanitumike. <verse eid="JHN 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45" />Ywanibona nenga ammona yu'lu' ywanitumike. <verse eid="JHN 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46" />Niisi mudunia panga na bweya li'nga boti babaniu'bi'lya kanebaigale mulubi'ndu'. <verse eid="JHN 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47" />Ywagayu'wa mayi'gi'yo gangu', lakini kakotoka kamwa, nenga namukumuli, kwa mwanjaa naisali ukumu dunia ila kwikosopolya. <verse eid="JHN 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48" />Ywakana kugakamwa mayi'gi'yo gangu', abile nakwe ywakumukumu. Liyi'gi'yo li'lu' lyanililongei nga akimu wake lisu'ba lya kuundi'la. <verse eid="JHN 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49" />Nenga nalongelali kwa makakala gangu' namwene, ila Tati' babanitumike ngabaniamulise nibaye ki'li' na nilongele ki'li'. <verse eid="JHN 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50" />Nenga ndangite panga amuli yake ileta ukoto wangayomoka. Nenga nibaya galu' Tati' gabaanilagile nigabaye bai.”<verse eid="JHN 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13" />
  <para style="s">Yesu agu'lwa magu'lu' atumilwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1" />Lyaaigali lisu'ba limo nnu'ngi' lyo timya kwa si'li'ku'si'li'ku' ya Pasika, Yesu aatangite panga saa yake yo bu'ka mudunia no yenda kwa Tati' yaikite. Aapendi bandu bake babaai mudunia, kakape aapendi mpaka kuundi'la!<verse eid="JHN 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2" />Bai, Yesu na banamasi' bake baai batami pakilyo sa kitamwiyo. Ibilisi ansopite Yuda, mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti, li'nga ansongi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3" />Yesu aatangite panga Tati' bampei kila kili'be, no panga aaumi kwa Nnu'ngu' na abukiya kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4" />Bai, aabu'i pamesa, ngabi'ka pambwega nganju yake, tola kitambala na kwitaba mukibuno. <verse eid="JHN 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5" />Bu'kapo ngayi'ya masi' mukibakuli, tumbwa kwagu'lwa banamasi' bake magu'lu' na kwaponwa kwa si'lu' kitambala saaitabite nkibuno. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus washes Peter's feet" file="cn01799C.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="13:5" /> <verse eid="JHN 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6" />Bai, paamwiki Simoni Petili, Petili ngabaya, “Bwana, upala kunigu'lwa nenga magu'lu'?” <verse eid="JHN 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Nambi'yambi' utangiteli sanikipanga, lakini nnu'ngi' waalu'a kitanga.” <verse eid="JHN 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8" />Petili ngammakia, “Wenga katu unigu'lwali magu'lu' gangu'!” Yesu ngayangwa, “Mana kaukana kukugu'lwa magu'lu' gako, katu walu'mbanali nanenga.” <verse eid="JHN 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9" />Simoni Petili ngannyangwa, “Bwana, unigu'lwe, kai' magu'lu' baili, ila maboko gangu' na ntwe.” <verse eid="JHN 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10" />Yesu ngammakia, “Ywau'gite ili'ngani ipalikwali uluwa ila magu'lu' bai, kwa mwanjaa yi'ga yake ipeletike. Mwenga mupeletike ila mwaboti lili.” <verse eid="JHN 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11" />(Yesu aantangite yu'lu' ywapalage kunsongya, kwa nyo ngabaya, “Mwenga mupeletike ila mwabotili.”)<verse eid="JHN 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12" />Paayomwi kwagu'lwa magu'lu' no wala kai' ngu'bo yake, ngatama pamesa, na kwabakia, “Buli, mulitangite likowe lyanimpangile? <verse eid="JHN 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13" />Mwenga munikema ‘Mwalimu’ na ‘Bwana’, mwenga mubaya kweli, kwa mwanjaa nga nenga. <verse eid="JHN 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14" />Bai, manaitei nenga ngana Bwana kai' na Mwalimu ninng'u'lwangite mwenga magu'lu', na mwenga mupalikwa gu'lwana magu'lu'. <verse eid="JHN 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15" />Ninnayangite makowe ga li'nga namwenga muyige mupange kati mwanimpangile. <verse eid="JHN 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16" />Kakape nimmakianga, ntumisi nku'lu' li kulikoni bwana wake, wala ntumilwa nku'lu' li kulikoni yu'lu' ywantumike. <verse eid="JHN 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17" />Bai, mana mugatangite ga, yapanga nantali mana mwaagapanga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 13:17">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Last supper - WA03909" file="LastSupper(12Disciples)_WA03909.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="13:17" /> <verse eid="JHN 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18" />“Aga ganigabaya kwenda ginu mwaboti li. Nenga naatangite balu' banaasawile. Lakini li'nga Maandiko Mapeleteu gatimi, <char style="qt">‘Yu'lu' ywaalile kilyo sangu' agalambwike kunitangya.’</char> <verse eid="JHN 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19" />Nimmakiangite makowe ga gabile balo pitya, li'nga pagaapitya mwau'bi'li panga nenga nga naywembe. <verse eid="JHN 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20" />Kakape nimmakianga, ywaampokya yu'lu' ywanintuma, anipokya nenga na ywanipokya nenga, ampokya yu'lu' ywanitumike.”<verse eid="JHN 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu alondwa panga asongelwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:20-25">Mat 26:20-25</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:17-21">Mal 14:17-21</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">Luk 22:21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21" />Paayomwi longela go, Yesu aapatike ntenyo muno pamwoyo wake, ngabaya mpu'la, “Kakape nimmakianga, yumo ywinu alu'a nisongya!” <verse eid="JHN 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22" />Banamasi' ngabalingana, pangali tanga panga ywaku' ywannongelya. <verse eid="JHN 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23" />Yumo ywa banamasi', ywaapendilwe na Yesu, aatami papipi na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24" />Bai, Simoni Petili ngampu'ngya luboko yu'lu' mwanamasi' no baya, “Nnokiye ammaya nyai.” <verse eid="JHN 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25" />Mwanamasi' ywo ngaegelya papipi muno na Yesu, ngannokiya, “Bwana, nga nyai?” <verse eid="JHN 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Yu'lu' ywanampeya king'esu sa likati lyanisuyite mukibakuli, nga ywembe.” Bai, ngaatola king'esu sa likati, ngakisuya, na kumpeya Yuda mwana wa Simoni Isikalioti. <verse eid="JHN 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27" />Yuda pakipokile king'esu so, Ibilisi ngannyingya. Bai, Yesu ngammakia, “Sopala panga ukipange kiyu'ngu'ya!” <verse eid="JHN 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28" />Lakini ntu'pu' ata yumo ywa balu' babaatami palu' pamesa ywaatangite kitumbu sa kummakia nyo. <verse eid="JHN 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29" />Kwa mwanjaa Yuda aabile mmi'ki wamabi'ko, bi'ngi' babe bakitage panga Yesu ammakiye api'me ili'be yaipalikwa kwa si'li'ku'si'li'ku', au iwesa panga ammakiye akapiye sosoti kwa aki'ba. <verse eid="JHN 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30" />Bai, Yuda paakitweti si'lu' king'esu sa likati, popopo ngapita panja. Na yaai kilo. <figure style="fig" alt="Judas leaving upper room - CN01802" file="JudasLeavingUpperRoom_John13.30_CN01802.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="13:30" /><verse eid="JHN 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amuli yayambi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31" />Bu'ka pa Yuda pitya panja, Yesu ngabaya, “Nambi'yambi' Mwana wa Mundu akwi'yilwe, naywembe Nnu'ngu' akwi'yilwe kwa ndi'la yake. <verse eid="JHN 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32" />Na manaitei Nnu'ngu' akwi'yilwe kwa ndi'la ya Mwana, naywembe Nnu'ngu' ankwi'ya Mwana kiyu'ngu'ya kwa ndi'la yake mwene.<verse eid="JHN 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33" />“Mwabana bangu', balo pasene baa pamope na mwenga. Mwaanipala, lakini nambi'yambi' nimmakia galu' ganaabakiye api'ndo ba Ayahudi, ‘Kwaniyenda mwenga mukombwali ika.’ <verse eid="JHN 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34" />Nimpeyanga amuli yayambi', Mupendane, kati nenga mwanimpendile mwenga, nyinyonyo na mwenga mupendane. <verse eid="JHN 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35" />Mana mupendine, bandu boti baalu'a tanga panga mwenga nga mwabanamasi' bangu'.”<verse eid="JHN 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu abaya panga alu'a kanilwa na Petili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mat 26:31-35</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Mal 14:27-31</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36" />Simoni Petili ngannaluya, “Bwana uyenda kwaku'?” Yesu ngannyangwa, “Kwaniyenda nambi'yambi' ukombwali kuniki'ngama, lakini waalu'a niki'ngama nnu'ngi' yake.” <verse eid="JHN 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37" />Petili ngammakia, “Bwana, kwa mwanjaa namani nikotoke kukuki'ngama nambi'yambi'? Niyi'ki'tile waa kwa kitumbu sako!” <verse eid="JHN 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Buli, kakape uyi'ki'tile waa kwa kitumbu sangu'? Kakape nikubakia, njogolo ai balo bi'ka waalu'a nikana patatu!”<verse eid="JHN 13:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14" />
  <para style="s">Yesu Ndi'la yo yenda kwa Tati'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Crosses seen through gateway - HK00325" file="CrossesSeenThroughGateway_HK00325.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="14:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Kanemube na kyukala mumyoyo yinu. Mumwu'bi'lya Nnu'ngu', muniu'bi'li na nenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2" />Munyumba ya Tati' bangu' muutamo mwambone. Ikapangage nyonyoli, nilu'e kummakia. Nambi'yambi' niyenda kummi'kyanga wiso muutamo. <verse eid="JHN 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3" />Na mana niyi'i kummi'kya muutamo, naalu'a buya kai' kuntolanga li'nga palu' panibile nenga, na mwenga mwaabe. <verse eid="JHN 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4" />Mwitangite ndi'la yo yenda akwo kwaniyenda.”<verse eid="JHN 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5" />Tomasi ngammakia, “Bwana, tutangiteli kwauyenda, tukombwabuli kwitanga ndi'la?” <verse eid="JHN 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Nenga ngana ndi'la, ukakape na ukoto. Ntu'pu' ywakombwa yenda kwa Tati' ila kwo pi'tya kasangu'. <verse eid="JHN 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7" />Kwa mwanjaa munitangite nenga, mulu'a kwatanga na Tati' bangu' kai'. No bu'ka nambi'yambi', mwatangite kai' mwabweni.”<verse eid="JHN 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8" />Pilipi ngammakia, “Bwana, utulangili Tati', na twenga yali'ngana.” <verse eid="JHN 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9" />Yesu ngammakia, “Nitami na mwenga kwa masu'ba ga goti, nawenga Pilipi unanitangali? Ywaanibweni nenga abweni na Tati'. Ukombwabuli baya, ‘Utulangili Tati'?’ <verse eid="JHN 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10" />Buli, uu'bi'lyali panga nenga nibi nkati ya Tati', nabembe Tati' babi nkati yangu'? Mayi'gi'yo ganimmakianga, nigalongelali kwa utawala wangu'. Ila Tati' bababile nkati yangu' bapanga lyengo lyabe. <verse eid="JHN 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11" />Mupalikwa kuniu'bi'lya panibaya panga nenga nibile nkati ya Tati' nabembe babile nkati yangu'. Mana lili, muu'bi'li kwa kitumbu sa makowe ganigapanga. <verse eid="JHN 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12" />Kakape nimmakianga, ywaniu'bi'lya alu'a panga makowe ganigapanga nenga, kai' alu'a panga maku'lu' muno, kwa mwanjaa niyenda kwa Tati'. <verse eid="JHN 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13" />Na sosoti samwaalu'a lu'ba kwa lina lyangu', naalu'a kipanga, li'nga Tati' bakwi'yi'lwe nkati ya Mwana. <verse eid="JHN 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14" />Mana munilu'bite sosoti kwa lina lyangu', naalu'a kumpangya.<verse eid="JHN 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Loo Mpeleteu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15" />“Mana munipendile mwaalu'a kwikamwa amuli yangu'. <verse eid="JHN 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16" />Nanenga nilu'a kwalu'ba Tati', na bembe baalu'a kumpeya Nnyangatiyi ywi'ngi' ywaalu'a tama na mwenga milele. <verse eid="JHN 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17" />Ywembe nga Loo ywa kakape. Dunia ikombwali kumpokya kwa mwanjaa ikombwali kummona wala kuntanga. Lakini mwenga muntangite kwa mwanjaa atama na mwenga na ai nkati yinu.<verse eid="JHN 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18" />“Naalu'a kunnekali muuki'ba, naalu'a isa kai' kasinu. <verse eid="JHN 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19" />Balo pasene dunia yaalu'a nibonali kai', lakini mwenga mwalu'a nibona. Kwa mwanjaa nenga nankoti, na mwenga mwapanga mwaakoti. <verse eid="JHN 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20" />Lisu'ba li'lu' palyaalu'a ika mwatanga panga nenga nibile nkati ya Tati', na mwenga nkati yangu', nanenga nkati yinu. <verse eid="JHN 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21" />Ywapokya amuli yangu' na kwikamwa, ywembe nga ywanipenda. Na ywanipenda nenga, aapendelwa na Tati' bangu', nanenga nalu'a kumpenda na kwilaya kasake.”<verse eid="JHN 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22" />Yuda (yu'lu' Isikalioti li) ngammakia, “Bwana, ukombwabuli kwilaya kasitu, lakini kwa dunia lili?” <verse eid="JHN 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23" />Yesu ngayangwa, “Mundu mana anipendile, alu'a kamwa liyi'gi'yo lyangu'. Tati' bangu' baalu'a kumpenda, na twenga twaalu'a isa kasake no tama nakwe. <verse eid="JHN 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24" />Ywakotoka kunipenda akamwali mayi'gi'yo gangu'. Na mayi'gi'yo gamugayu'wine gangu' lili, ila ga Tati' babanitumike.<verse eid="JHN 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25" />“Nimmakiangite makowe ga nibile balo pamope na mwenga, <verse eid="JHN 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26" />lakini Nnyangatiyi, Loo Mpeleteu bembe Tati' baalu'a kuntuma kwa lina lyangu', alu'a kunnyi'gana kila kili'be na kunku'mbu'ki'yanga goti ganammakiye.<verse eid="JHN 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27" />“Amani nendakunekya, nimpeyanga amani yangu'. Nimpeyangali kati dunia mwaimpeya. Kanemube na kyukala wala yogopa. <verse eid="JHN 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28" />Mwaaniyu'wine mu'lu' mwanammakiye, ‘Nendabu'ka kasangu' ila naalu'a buya kai' kasinu.’ Kenda mukanipenda, mulu'e napusika kwa mwanjaa niyenda kwa Tati', nabembe nga aku'lu' pi'ta nenga. <verse eid="JHN 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29" />Nimmakiangite makowe ga nambi'yambi' gai balo pitya, li'nga pagaalu'a pitya mwapate u'bi'lya. <verse eid="JHN 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30" />Naalu'a longelali kai' na mwenga makowe gambone, kwa mwanjaa mpi'ndo ywa dunia yi'no endaisa. Ywembe ntu'pu' uweso kasangu' nenga, <verse eid="JHN 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31" />li'nga dunia itange panga napendi Tati', nanenga nipanga mu'mu'lu'mu'lu' kati Tati' mwabaaniamulise. Muyi'me, tubu'ke pano.”<verse eid="JHN 14:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15" />
  <para style="s">Yesu nnjabibu wa kakape</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Vine and grapes - LB00107" file="Vine&amp;Grapes+Supports_LB00107.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="15:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1" />“Nenga na kitepo sa nnjabibu wa kakape, na Tati' bangu' nga ali'mi. <verse eid="JHN 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2" />Kila lutambi' nkati yangu' lwalukotoka pambika ywembe endalubu'ya, na kila lutambi' lwalupambika endalupetulya, li'nga lupambike munomuno. <verse eid="JHN 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3" />Mwenga muyomwike petulilwa kwa li'lu' liyi'gi'yo lyanimmakiyangite. <verse eid="JHN 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4" />Mutame nkati yangu' nane nkati yinu. Kati lutambi' mwalukotoka pambika pangali tama mukitepo, nyinyonyo mwenga mukombwali pambika pangali tama nkati yangu'.<verse eid="JHN 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5" />“Nenga nga na nnjabibu, mwenga mwakindambi'. Ywatama nkati yangu', nane nkati yake, aywo aapambika munomuno, kwa mwanjaa pangali nenga mukombwali panga kili'be sosoti. <verse eid="JHN 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6" />Mundu ywoywoti ywakotoka tama nkati yangu' aataikulilwa panja kati lutambi' lwalutaikulilwe no yu'ma. Bandu baalutondwa na kulutaikulya pamwoto lutinike. <verse eid="JHN 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7" />Mana mutami nkati yangu' na mayi'gi'yo gangu' nkati yinu, mulu'be sosoti samupala mwapeyelwa. <verse eid="JHN 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8" />Tati' bangu' baakwi'yi'lwa mana mwapambika munomuno no panga mwabanamasi' bangu'. <verse eid="JHN 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9" />Nenga nimpendi mwenga kati Tati' mwabanipendi nenga. Mutamange mulipendo lyangu'. <verse eid="JHN 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10" />Mana mwaikolea amuli yangu' mwalu'a tama mulipendo lyangu', kati nenga mwaniikoleyite amuli ya Tati' bangu' no tama mulipendo lyabe.<verse eid="JHN 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11" />“Nimmakiangite makowe gano li'nga pulaa yangu' itame nkati yinu, na pulaa yinu itimi. <verse eid="JHN 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12" />Amuli yangu' nga yi'no. Mupendane kati mwanimpendi mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13" />Ntu'pu' upendo nku'lu' muno kulikoni wa mundu kuupiya bwu'mi wake kwa kitumbu sa mambwiga bake. <verse eid="JHN 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14" />Mwenga mwamambwiga bangu', mana mwapanga kati mwanimwamulisa. <verse eid="JHN 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15" />Mwenga ninkemangali kai' mwatumisi, kwa mwanjaa ntumisi atangali sakipanga bwana wake. Lakini nenga ninkemite mwenga mwamambwiga, kwa mwanjaa nimmakiangite goti ganigayu'wine bu'ka kwa Tati' bangu'. <verse eid="JHN 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16" />Mwenga munisawili nenga, ila nenga nganinsawi mwenga, na kuntuma muyende mukapambike, itunda yo tamilika, nabembe Tati' bampeya sosoti samwaalu'a kwalu'ba kwa lina lyangu'. <verse eid="JHN 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17" />Bai amuli yangu' kasinu nga yi'no, mupendane.<verse eid="JHN 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Suki ya dunia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18" />“Manaitei bandu ba padunia kabansukya mwenga mutange panga baalongwi wi'ti' kunisukya nenga. <verse eid="JHN 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19" />Mukapangage mwabandu ba padunia, bandu ba padunia balu'e kumpenda kati mwabandu babe. Lakini kwa mwanjaa mwenga mwabandu ba padunia li, ila nenga ninsawi bu'ka padunia, kwa nyo dunia yenda kunsukya. <verse eid="JHN 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20" />Muku'mbu'ki ganammakiye, ‘Ntumisi nku'lu' li kulikoni bwana wake.’ Kwa mwanjaa baaniku'su'mbwi nenga, balu'a kunku'su'mbwa kai' na mwenga, mana baalikamwi liyi'gi'yo lyangu' baalikamwa kai' na linu. <verse eid="JHN 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21" />Lakini ago goti baalu'a kumpangya mwenga kwa kitumbu sa lina lyangu', kwa mwanjaa bantangiteli ywanitumite. <verse eid="JHN 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22" />Ngakotoka isa no longela nabo, bapalage bali na sambi, lakini nambi'yambi' bakombwali kwikengya panga ntu'pu' sambi. <verse eid="JHN 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23" />Ywanisukwa nenga, asukwa na Tati' bangu' kai'. <verse eid="JHN 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24" />Ngakotoka kugapanga kasabe makowe gagaai ganapangilwali na mundu ywi'ngi', balu'e bali na sambi. Lakini nambi'yambi' bagabweni ganigapangite baatinisukya nenga na Tati' bangu' kai'. <verse eid="JHN 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25" />Lakini bapangite nya li'nga mayi'gi'yo gagaandikilwe musalya yabe gatimi, <char style="qt">‘Baanisuki pangali kitumbu.’ </char><verse eid="JHN 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26" />“Paalu'a isa aywo Nnyangatiyi ywanalu'a kuntuma kasinu bu'ka kwa Tati', aywo Loo ywa kakape ywabu'ka kwa Tati', ywembe ywo aanikong'ondelya. <verse eid="JHN 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27" />Na mwenga mwanikong'ondelya kai' kwa mwanjaa mwaabile nanenga bu'ka patumbu.”<verse eid="JHN 15:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1" />“Nimmakiye go, li'nga mwaakane kwiobea imani yinu. <verse eid="JHN 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2" />Bandu balu'a kummi'nga mwenga mumayumba gabe ga kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu'. Kai' nsimu wendaisa wa kila ywaalu'a kummulaga mwenga, aakita antumikia Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3" />Baalu'a kumpangya go kwa mwanjaa baatangiteli Tati', wala banitangiteli nenga. <verse eid="JHN 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4" />Bai, nimmakiye makowe ga li'nga payaika saa yake mwaku'mbu'ki panga nammakiye.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:4">Lyengo lya Loo Mpeleteu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">“Nimmakiyeli makowe gano bu'ka patumbu, kwa mwanjaa naabile pamope na mwenga. <verse eid="JHN 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5" />Nambi'yambi' ninnyendelya ywanitumike, na ntu'pu' ata yumo ywanilaluya panga, ‘Uyenda kwaku'?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6" />Kwa mwanjaa nimmakiye makowe go, myoyo yinu itwi'li usuni. <verse eid="JHN 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7" />Lakini nimmakiyanga, nantali yinu nenga niyende, mwanjaa mana nikotwike yenda, Nnyangatiyi aisali. Lakini mana niyi'i nalu'a kuntuma kasinu. <verse eid="JHN 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8" />Naywembe paaisa alu'a kwakong'ondelya bandu ba padunia bu'kana na sambi, aki na ukumu ya Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9" />Bu'kana na sambi, mwanjaa baniu'bi'lyali, <verse eid="JHN 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10" />bu'kana na aki, mwanjaa niyenda kwa Tati', namwe mwanibonali kai', <verse eid="JHN 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11" />bu'kana na ukumu, mwanjaa mpi'ndo ywa dunia yi'no ayomwike ukumilwa.<verse eid="JHN 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12" />“Nibile na maingi ga kummakianga, ila kwa nambi'yambi' mukombwali kugakomeya. <verse eid="JHN 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13" />Lakini paalu'a isa aywo Loo ywa kweli, aalu'a kunnongoya mukweli yoti, mwanjaa aalongelali kwa utawala wake mwene, ila aabaya gaagayu'wa na kummakianga gagaalu'a isa. <verse eid="JHN 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14" />Ywembe anikwi'ya nenga, kwa mwanjaa aalu'a kummakianga galu' gaalu'a kugapata bu'ka kasangu'. <verse eid="JHN 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15" />Goti gababilenago Tati' nga gangu', mwanjaa nibaite panga aywo Loo aalu'a kummakianga galu' gaalu'a kugapata bu'ka kasangu'.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 16:15">Usunika no pulaa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:15">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus with 6 disciples - CN01732" file="JesusWith6Disciples_CN01732.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="16:15" /> <verse eid="JHN 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16" />“Balo masu'ba masene namwe mwanibonali, no bu'ka pamasu'ba masene kai' mwanibona.” <verse eid="JHN 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17" />Apo bi'ngi' ba banamasi' bake ngabalaluyana, “Alombolya namani patubakia, ‘Balo masu'ba masene namwe mwanibonali, no bu'ka pamasu'ba masene mwanibona kai'?’ Kai' abaya, ‘Kwa mwanjaa nendayenda kwa Tati'!’” <verse eid="JHN 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18" />Bai ngabalaluyana, “Alombolya namani pabaya, ‘Balo masu'ba masene?’ Tutangiteli alongela ki'li'.” <verse eid="JHN 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19" />Yesu aatangite panga baapalike kunnaluya, bai ngaabakia, “Buli, mulaluyana galu' ganimmakiye panga, ‘Balo masu'ba masene namwe mwanibonali, no bu'ka pamasu'ba masene mwanibona kai'?’ <verse eid="JHN 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20" />Kakape nimmakianga, mwenga mwali'la no lombola, lakini bandu ba dunia balu'a napusika, mwalu'a usunika, lakini usunika kwinu kwagalambuka panga pulaa. <verse eid="JHN 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21" />Nnwawa pabaa kumbeleka endausunika kwa mwanjaa saa yake ya lwu'ngu' yikite, lakini mana akombwike aku'mbu'kyali kai' lwu'ngu' lwo kwa kitumbu sa pulaa, panga mundu abelekwile padunia. <verse eid="JHN 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22" />Kai' mwenga nambi'yambi' mwendausunika, lakini nalu'a kumwisilyanga kai', na mwenga myoyo yinu yatwi'lya pulaa, na pulaa yo ntu'pu' mundu ywaalu'a kwibu'ya kasinu. <verse eid="JHN 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23" />Lisu'ba lyo mwanilaluyali sosoti. Kakape nimmakianga, sosoti samwalu'a kwalu'ba Tati' kwa lina lyangu' bampeyanga. <verse eid="JHN 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24" />Mpaka nambi'yambi' munalu'bali sosoti kwa lina lyangu'. Mulu'bange na mwenga mwapata li'nga pulaa yinu itimi.<verse eid="JHN 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Niisindike dunia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25" />“Nimmakiangite makowe go kwa ngongo. Lakini nsimu waaisa apo, nalongelali namwenga kwa ngongo, ila nalu'a kummakianga mpu'la abali ya Tati'. <verse eid="JHN 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26" />Lisu'ba lyo mwalu'a lu'ba kwa lina lyangu', na nimmakiangali panga nalu'a kunnu'ba Tati' paali pinu mwenga, <verse eid="JHN 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27" />mwanjaa ywembe endakumpenda mwenga, kwa mwanjaa mwenga munipendi nenga na mwu'bi'li panga nibu'ka kwa Nnu'ngu'. <verse eid="JHN 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28" />Nenga naumi kwa Tati', isa mudunia, na nambi'yambi' niileka dunia no ki'li'bu'kya kwa Tati'.”<verse eid="JHN 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29" />Bai banamasi' bake ngabammakia, “Kumbe! Nambi'yambi' ulongela mpu'la pangali ngongo. <verse eid="JHN 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30" />Nambi'yambi' tutangite panga wenga utangite kila kili'be, na ntu'pu' kitumbu so laluyilwa maswali na mundu ywoywoti, kwa nyo tuu'bi'lile panga waumi kwa Nnu'ngu'.” <verse eid="JHN 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31" />Yesu ngaayangwa, “Buli nambi'yambi' mwu'bi'lile? <verse eid="JHN 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32" />Nsimu wendaisa, kai' uikite wa mwenga mwaboti talanganika kila mundu kwa kisake, nanenga nalekelwa kisangu'. Lakini nenga nibali kisangu' mwanjaa, Tati' bai pamope nanenga. <verse eid="JHN 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33" />Nimmakiangite makowe gano li'nga mupate ba na amani kwa mwanjaa mubile nkati yangu'. Mudunia mwapata siki, lakini mwikase, nenga niisindike dunia!”<verse eid="JHN 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17" />
  <para style="s">Yesu alu'bya banamasi' bake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1" />Yesu paayomwi longela go, aaloi kunani, ngabaya, “Tati', yi'lu' saa yikite! Munkwi'ye Mwana winu li'nga naywembe ankwi'ye. <verse eid="JHN 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2" />Mwanjaa mwaampei mwana winu utawala kwa bandu boti, li'nga apei ukoto wangayomoka boti bamwampeile. <verse eid="JHN 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3" />Na ukoto wangayomoka nga wu'no, kuntanga mwenga mwamubile kisinu mwa Nnu'ngu' wa kakape, na kuntanga Yesu Kilisitu ywamuntumike. <verse eid="JHN 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4" />Tati', nenga ninkwi'yite pano padunia, niyomolile li'lu' lyengo lyamwanipeile nilipange. <verse eid="JHN 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5" />Nambi'yambi', Tati', munikwi'ye nnu'ngi' yinu kwa gu'lu' utukupu wanaabile nawo payabile balo dunia umbilwa.<verse eid="JHN 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6" />“Nimpangite mutanganikwe kwa bandu bamwanipeile bu'ka mudunia. Baai bandu binu, na mwenga mwanipei babe bangu', nabembe balikamwile liyi'gi'yo linu. <verse eid="JHN 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7" />Nambi'yambi' batangite panga kila samunipeile kibu'kite kasinu. <verse eid="JHN 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8" />Nenga napeile yi'lu' abali yamwanipeile, nabembe baipokile, batangite panga kakape niuma kasinu, na bendau'bi'lya panga ngamwaanitumike.<verse eid="JHN 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9" />“Nalu'bya bo, niilu'byali dunia, ila nalu'bya balu' bamwanipeile kwa mwanjaa nga binu. <verse eid="JHN 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10" />Boti banibile nabo nga binu, na binu nga bangu', na utukupu wangu' ubonekine mwa balu' bamunipeile. <verse eid="JHN 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11" />Na nambi'yambi' niisa kasinu, nibileli kai' mudunia, lakini bembe bai mudunia. Mwa Tati' Mwapeleteu! Kwa makakala ga lina linu lyamunipeile, nilu'ba mwali'ndi'le li'nga babe kili'be simo kati twenga mwatubile twabamo. <verse eid="JHN 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12" />Panaabile nabo nenga, naatikwali'ndi'la kwa makakala ga lina linu lyamunipeile. Nenga naatikwali'ndi'la, ntu'pu' ata yumo ywaaobite ila yu'lu' ywapalikwa langamiswa, li'nga Maandiko Mapeleteu gatimi. <verse eid="JHN 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13" />Bai, nambi'yambi' niisa kasinu, na nibaite makowe gano nibile balo padunia, li'nga bakombwe ba nsawani mupula yangu'. <verse eid="JHN 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14" />Nenga naapeile abali yako, nabembe ba dunia ngabaasukwa, kwa mwanjaa bembe ba dunia li, kati nenga mwanibileli ywa dunia. <verse eid="JHN 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15" />Nilu'bali mwabu'ye mudunia, ila nilu'ba mwali'ndi'le na yu'lu' nnau. <verse eid="JHN 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16" />Bembe ba dunia li kati nenga mwanibile na ywa dunia li. <verse eid="JHN 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17" />Mwabi'ke wiso kwa ukakape, liyi'gi'yo linu nga kakape. <verse eid="JHN 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18" />Kati mwamunitumike mudunia, nanenga kai' natumike bembe mudunia, <verse eid="JHN 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19" />paali pabembe nenga namwene niibi'ka wiso kukutumikia, li'nga nabembe babi'ki'lwe wiso muukakape.<verse eid="JHN 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20" />“Nalu'byali abo bai, ila nalu'bya boti babalu'a niu'bi'lya bu'kana na abali yabe. <verse eid="JHN 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21" />Nilu'ba boti babe kili'be simo, Tati'! Nilu'ba babe nkati yitu kati mwenga mwamubile nkati yangu' nanenga nkati yinu. Nilu'ba babe kili'be simo li'nga dunia iu'bi'li panga mwenga nga mwamunitumike. <verse eid="JHN 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22" />Nenga napei utukupu gu'gu'lu'gu'lu' wamwanipeile, li'nga babe kili'be simo kati twenga mwatubile twabamo, <verse eid="JHN 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23" />nenga nibe nkati yabe, na mwenga mube nkati yangu', nilu'ba babi'ki'lwe wiso no ba kili'be simo, li'nga dunia itange panga mwenga ngamwamunitumike na mwapendi bembe kati mwamunipendi nenga.<verse eid="JHN 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24" />“Tati', mbala abo bamunipeile babe pamope nanenga palu' panibile li'nga baubone utukupu wangu' wamwanipeile, kwa mwanjaa mwalongwi wi'ti' kunipenda ibile balo umbilwa dunia. <verse eid="JHN 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25" />Mwa Tati' Anogau! Dunia intangiteli, lakini nenga nintangite. Bano bembe batangite panga mwenga nga mwamunitumike. <verse eid="JHN 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26" />Nimpangite mutanganikwe kwabe na nilu'a yendelya panga nyo, li'nga upendo wamubile nawo kasangu' ube nkati yabe, nanenga nibe nkati yabe.”<verse eid="JHN 17:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18" />
  <para style="s">Yesu endaboyolwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat 26:47-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mal 14:43-50</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22:47-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1" />Yesu paayomwi longela go, ngayenda pamope na banamasi' bake. Baayi'i kwiyi' ya lukolongo lwa Kedroni. Pandu po paai mukyati', Yesu pamope na banamasi' bake ngabayingya mo. <verse eid="JHN 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2" />Yuda ywaansongi Yesu, aapatangite pandu po kwa mwanjaa Yesu akokotyage kwembana po na banamasi' bake. <verse eid="JHN 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3" />Bai, Yuda aakitweti kipi'nga sa asikali na ali'ndi'li babaatumilwe na api'ndo ba dini na Mafalisayo, ngaisa nabo mukyati' bapu'twile na taa, yenge na yombo ya ngondo. <figure style="fig" alt="Judas betrays Jesus in the garden" file="cn01812C.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © 1996 David C. Cook" ref="18:3" /> <verse eid="JHN 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4" />Yesu aatangite goti gagalu'a kumpata, ngaayendelya na kwalaluya, “Mumpala nyai?” <verse eid="JHN 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5" />Nabembe ngabannyangwa, “Yesu Nnasaleti.” Yesu ngaabakia “Nga nenga” Nsongi Yuda aai ayi'mi pamope nabo.<verse eid="JHN 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6" />Bai, Yesu paabakiye, “Nga nenga,” ngabaki'li'bu'kya nsu'gu' no tu'la pai'. <verse eid="JHN 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7" />Yesu ngaalaluya kai', “Mumpala nyai?” Ngabannyangwa, “Yesu Nnasaleti.” <verse eid="JHN 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Nimmakiangite panga nenga nga naywembe. Bai mana kamunipala nenga, mwaleke banamasi' bangu' babu'kange.” <verse eid="JHN 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9" />Agalongei go li'nga gatimi gaalongei, “Balu' bawanipeile nimwobiyeli ata yumo.” <verse eid="JHN 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10" />Simoni Petili abile na lipanga, bai ngalisolomwa, ngankata likutu lya kummalyo ntumisi ywa mpi'ndo ywa dini. Ntumisi ywo akemelwage Malko. <verse eid="JHN 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11" />Bai, Yesu ngammakia Petili, “Uki'li'bu'ye lipanga lyako mulupata. Buli, nipalikwali nywelya nnobo wa ngu'su'mbu' wabanipei Tati'?”<verse eid="JHN 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nnu'ngi' ya mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12" />Kipi'nga sa asikali na mpi'ndo wabe pamope na ali'ndi'li ba Ayahudi baammoywi Yesu, ngabantaba <verse eid="JHN 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13" />na kumpeleka kwa Anasi nkiwe Kayafa, ywaabile mpi'ndo nku'lu' ywa dini mwaka wo. <verse eid="JHN 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14" />Aywo Kayafa nga ywaabakiye api'ndo ba Ayahudi panga nantali mundu yumo awee paali pa bandu.<verse eid="JHN 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili ankana Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-70">Mat 26:69-70</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:66-68">Mal 14:66-68</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:55-57">Luk 22:55-57</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15" />Simoni Petili na mwanamasi' ywi'ngi' baanki'ngime Yesu. Aywo mwanamasi' ywi'ngi' atanganikwe kwa mpi'ndo ywa dini, kwa nyo ayingi pamope na Yesu pangu'lu' munyumba ya mpi'ndo ywa dini. <verse eid="JHN 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16" />Lakini Petili aayi'mi panja, paniango. Bai, aywo mwanamasi' ywaatanganikwe na mpi'ndo ywa dini aapitike panja, ngalongela na mwi'nja nni'ndi'li wa niango, ngaannyingia Petili nkati ya luwa. <verse eid="JHN 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17" />Aywo mwi'nja nni'ndi'la niango ngaannaluya Petili, “Buli, wenga nga yumo ywa banamasi' ba mundu yu'?” Petili ngammakia, “Nenga lili!”<verse eid="JHN 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18" />Atumisi na ali'ndi'li baakungine mwoto kwa mwanjaa kwabile na mbepo, ngababa kabayota. Naywembe Petili aayi'mi pamope nabo kayota mwoto.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:18">Mpi'ndo ywa dini ampekeseni Yesu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:18">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mat 26:59-66</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mal 14:55-64</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:66-71">Luk 22:66-71</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:18">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus' trial before priests - CN01815" file="Jesus'TrialBeforePriests_CN01815.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="18:18" /> <verse eid="JHN 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19" />Bai, mpi'ndo ywa dini ngannaluya Yesu bu'kana na banamasi' bake na mayi'gano gake. <verse eid="JHN 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Naalongei na kila mundu pabandu. Naatiyi'gana mumayumba ga kunnu'ba Nnu'ngu' na munyumba ya Nnu'ngu', pandu pabakwembana Ayahudi boti. Nalongelali sosoti kwo iya. <verse eid="JHN 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21" />Kwa mwanjaa buli unilaluya? Walaluye babaayu'wine ki'li' sanaabakiye. Bembe batangite sanaabakiye.” <verse eid="JHN 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22" />Paayomwi longela go nni'ndi'li yumo ywaayi'mi na Yesu ngaanku'mbwa mbande kabaya, “Unnyangwa buli nyo mpi'ndo ywa dini?” <verse eid="JHN 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Manaitei nilongei kinanyata ubaye awo unyatau, lakini mana nilongei kinannoga, mboni wendaniku'mbwa?” <verse eid="JHN 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24" />Bai, Anasi ngampeleka Yesu, abile ntabilwa, kwa mpi'ndo ywa dini Kayafa.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:24">Petili ankana Yesu kai'</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:24">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Peter denies knowing Jesus 2nd time - CN01819" file="PeterDeniesKnowingJesus(2ndTime)_CN01819.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="18:24" /> <verse eid="JHN 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25" />Bai, Petili aayi'mi po kayota mwoto ngabannaluya, “Buli, wenga wa yumo ywa banamasi' bake?” Ywembe ngakana, “Nenga lili!” <verse eid="JHN 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26" />Yumo ywa atumisi ba mpi'ndo ywa dini, nnongo wa yu'lu' ywaakatilwe likutu na Petili, ngannaluya, “Buli, nakubwenili kukyati' pamope nakwe?” <verse eid="JHN 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27" />Petili ngakana kai', popopo njogolo ngabi'ka.<verse eid="JHN 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu nnu'ngi' ya Pilato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28" />Kindai' bulabula baantweti Yesu bu'ka kwa Kayafa, kumpeleka kunyumba ya liwali. Lakini baayingili nnyumba, kwa mwanjaa yingya kwabe mu'lu' waai mwilo kwo lya kilyo sa Pasika. <verse eid="JHN 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29" />Kwa nyo, Pilato aatikwayendelya panja, ngabaya, “Mubile na masitaka gaku' kwa mundu yu'?” <verse eid="JHN 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30" />Ngabannyangwa, “Ikapangage mundu yu' apangiteli ulau tupelekunnetali kasako.” <verse eid="JHN 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31" />Pilato ngaabakia, “Muntole mwabene, mukansenwe bu'kana na salya yinu.” Api'ndo ba Ayahudi ngabannyangwa, “Twenga tuyi'ki'ti'lwali kummulaga mundu ywoywoti.” <verse eid="JHN 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32" />Yaapangilwe nyo li'nga gatimi mayi'gi'yo gaalongei Yesu panga awaa kiwo saku'. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus' trial before Pilate - WA03921" file="Jesus'TrialBeforePilate_WA03921.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="18:32" /> <verse eid="JHN 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33" />Pilato ngayingya kai' munyumba ya liwali, ngaankema Yesu na kunnaluya, “Ati' wenga nga Nkulungwa wa Ayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Buli, ago mayi'gi'yo gako au bi'ngi' batikubakia abali yangu'?” <verse eid="JHN 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35" />Pilato ngannyangwa, “Nenga na Nnyahudi lili! Bandu bako na api'ndo ba dini yako ngabakuletike kasangu'. Upangite ki'li'?” <verse eid="JHN 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Ukulungwa wangu' wa padunia li. Ikapangage ukulungwa wangu' wa padunia yi'no, atumisi bangu' bapelenikengelya kanenikamuyi'lwe mmoko ga api'ndo ba Ayahudi. Lakini ukulungwa wangu' wa pano li.” <verse eid="JHN 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37" />Apo Pilato ngammakia, “Wenga nga Wankulungwa?” Yesu ngayangwa, “Wenga ngawaubaya panga nenga nga Nankulungwa. Nenga nibelekwi kwa kitumbu so, na kwa nyo niisi mudunia kwabakia bandu abali ya kakape. Kila mundu ywa ukakape aanipi'kania.” <verse eid="JHN 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38" />Pilato ngammakia, “Ukakape nga kili'be gani?”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 18:38">Yesu aukumilwa waa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 18:38">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mat 27:15-31</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:6-20">Mal 15:6-20</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23:13-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">Pilato paayomwi longela go, aapiti kai' panja, ngaabakia Ayahudi, “Nenga nikibonali ata kitumbu simo sa kunsitakya mundu yu'. <verse eid="JHN 18:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39" />Lakini bu'kana na mayobelya ginu panga nenga ninnyu'gu'lyange ntabilwe yumo masu'ba ga Pasika. Bai, mupala ninnyu'gu'lyange Nkulungwa wa Ayahudi?” <verse eid="JHN 18:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40" />Apo ngabapanga ndu'ti, “Ata! Ayu' lili, ila Balaba!” Naywembe Balaba aai mpokonyoli.<verse eid="JHN 18:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19" />
  <para style="s">Pilato apaya kunnyu'gu'lya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Soldiers mocking Jesus - GT00086" file="SoldiersMockingJesus(CrownOfThorns)_Luke22.63-65_GT00086.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="19:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1" />Bai, Pilato ngaamulisa Yesu aku'mbu'lwe mikwasu. <verse eid="JHN 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2" />Asikali ngabalu'ka kapiya ya mimimwa na kunng'walika muntwe, ngabanng'walika na nganju ya lukanda lwa sambalau. <verse eid="JHN 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3" />Ngabaisa nnu'ngi' yake no baya, “Sikamu, Nkulungwa wa Ayahudi!” Ngabanku'mbwa mbande. <verse eid="JHN 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4" />Pilato aapitike panja kai', ngaabakia, “Ninneta Yesu kasinu, li'nga mutange panga nikibwenili kitumbu sa kumpanga aukumilwe.” <verse eid="JHN 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5" />Bai, Yesu ngapita panja aweti kapiya yailu'kilwe kwa mimimwa na nganju ya lukanda lwa sambalau. Pilato ngaabakia, “Lolange! Mundu wene nga aywo.” <verse eid="JHN 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6" />Api'ndo ba dini na ali'ndi'li pabaamweni baatu'ndu'biye malobe, “Ummambe! Ummambe munsalaba!” Pilato ngaabakia, “Muntolange mwabene mukammambe, kwa mwanjaa nenga nikibonali kitumbu sosoti sa kumukumu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7" />Ayahudi ngabannyangwa, “Twenga tubilenayo salya, no bu'kana na salya yo ipalikwa awee kwa mwanjaa aaipangite Mwana wa Nnu'ngu'.”<verse eid="JHN 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8" />Pilato paayu'wine mayi'gi'yo go ngayogopa munomuno. <verse eid="JHN 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9" />Bai, ngayingya nnyumba ya liwali kai' ngaannaluya Yesu, “Wenga wumi kwaku'?” Lakini Yesu annyangwili. <verse eid="JHN 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10" />Kwa nyo Pilato ngammakia, “Ulongelali nanenga? Buli, utangiteli panga nibile nawo utawala wa kukuyu'gu'lya na wa kukubamba?”<verse eid="JHN 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Wenga ubileli na utawala wowoti kasangu', ila wu'lu' wopeyelwa na Nnu'ngu'. Kwa mwanjaa, yu'lu' ywanikamukiye kasako ai na sambi ngu'lu' muno.” <verse eid="JHN 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12" />Bu'ka po, Pilato aai kapala ndi'la ya kunnekekea, lakini Ayahudi ngabapanga ndu'ti, “Mana wannekekea mundu yu', wenga wambwigalyeli Kaisali. Kila mundu ywaaipanga nkulungwa antaukya Kaisali!” <verse eid="JHN 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13" />Bai, Pilato waagayu'wine mayi'gi'yo go nganneta Yesu panja, bu'kapo Pilato ngatama pakiti'gu' sa ukumu, pandu papakemelwa “Sakafu ya Maliwe” (kwa Kiebrania, Gabasa).<verse eid="JHN 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14" />Yaai saa sita muntwekati lisu'ba lyo bi'ka wiso kwa Pasika. Pilato ngaabakia Ayahudi, “Ayu' nga nkulungwa winu!” <verse eid="JHN 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15" />Lakini bembe bapangite ndu'ti, “Ummulage! Ummulage! Ummambe munsalaba!” Pilato ngaalaluya, “Buli, nimmambe nkulungwa winu?” Api'ndo ba dini ngabannyangwa, “Twenga ntu'pu' nkulungwa ila Kaisali!” <verse eid="JHN 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16" />Pilato ngaakamukiya Yesu mmoko gabe li'nga abambilwe.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Yesu abambilwa munsalaba</para>
  <para style="r" vid="JHN 19:16">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat 27:32-44</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mal 15:21-32</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23:26-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Bai, ngabantola Yesu. <figure style="fig" alt="Three Crosses - GT00087" file="ThreeCrosses_Luke23.33_GT00087.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="19:16" /> <verse eid="JHN 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17" />Abu'i apu'twile nsalaba wake mpaka pandu papakemelwa “Lipakala lya Ntwe” (kwa Kiebrania Golgotha). <verse eid="JHN 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18" />Apo nga pabammambite, pamope nakwe baabambilwe bandu bi'ngi' abi'li', yumo lwamalyo na ywi'ngi' kunki'ya, na Yesu pakatikati. <verse eid="JHN 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19" />Pilato aamulise liandikilwe lilu'nga libi'ki'lwe panani ya nsalaba. Na lyembe lyaandikilwe nnyinya, “Yesu Nnasaleti, Nkulungwa wa Ayahudi.” <verse eid="JHN 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20" />Ayahudi baalisomike lilu'nga lyo, kwa mwanjaa apo paabambilwe Yesu paai papipi na kilambo. Kai' lilu'nga lyo lyaandikilwe kwa Kiebrania, Kiroma na Kigiliki. <verse eid="JHN 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21" />Bai, api'ndo ba dini ngabammakia Pilato, “Kaneuandike ‘Nkulungwa wa Ayahudi,’ ila ‘Ywembe aabaite, Nenga nga Nankulungwa wa Ayahudi.’” <verse eid="JHN 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22" />Pilato ngayangwa, “Ganiandike, niandike!”<verse eid="JHN 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23" />Asikali pabaayomwi kummamba Yesu, magu'bo gake ngabagabagana mapungu nsese, lipungu limo kwa kila asikali. Kai' baatweti na nganju yake, yayaapumilwe pangali sonelwa bu'ka kunani mpaka pai', yawesekineli baganika. <verse eid="JHN 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24" />Abo asikali ngababakiana, “Kanetuipopwane, ila tuipangi mpumbe yapanga ya nyai.” Likowe lyo lyapangilwe li'nga gatimi Maandiko Mapeleteu gagabaya, <char style="qt">“Batibagana iwalo yangu', na ngu'bo yangu' baipangi mpumbe.”</char> Amo nga mwabaapangite abo asikali.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:24">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Mary John &amp; Women at cross - CN01840" file="MaryJohn&amp;WomenAtCross_John19.25-27_CN01840.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="19:24" /> <verse eid="JHN 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25" />Papipi na nsalaba wake Yesu baayi'mi mau' bake, nku'we mau' bake, Malia nnyumbowe Kleopa na Malia Makatalena. <verse eid="JHN 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26" />Yesu paabweni mau' bake, na papipi yake ayi'mi yu'lu' mwanamasi' ywaampendile, ngaabakia mau' bake, “Mau'! Mulole, aywo nga mwana winu.” <verse eid="JHN 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27" />Bu'kapo ngammakia yu'lu' mwanamasi', “Ulole aywo nga mau' bako.” Na tangu' saa yi'lu' aywo mwanamasi' antweti mau' bake Yesu atame kasake.<verse eid="JHN 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu endawaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat 27:45-56</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mal 15:33-41</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23:44-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28" />Yesu pabweni panga goti gatimile, no li'nga Maandiko Mapeleteu gatimi, ngabaya, “Niminya nnyota.” <verse eid="JHN 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29" />Apo paabile na bakuli lyalitwi'li kasiki. Bai ngabampeya kasiki kwa lutengo lwa malu'ba ga hisopo, na kumwekekeya pankano wake. <verse eid="JHN 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30" />Yesu paayomwi pokya yo kasiki ngabaya, “Gatimile!” Ngakotima na kwipiya loo yake.<verse eid="JHN 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu aomelwa nkwa mumbau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31" />Yaai Ijumaa, lisu'ba lyo bi'ka wiso kwa Sabato. Kwa nyo li'nga mitwi kaneitame munsalaba lisu'ba lya Sabato, mwanjaa lisu'ba lyo lyaai liku'lu', api'ndo ba Ayahudi baannu'bite Pilato magu'lu' ga abo bababambilwe gati'kwanilwe na mitwi yabe ibu'yi'lwe. <verse eid="JHN 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32" />Bai, asikali baayi'i ti'kwana magu'lu' ga yu'lu' ywa kumbito na yu'lu' ywenebi'li' babaabile babambilwe pamope na Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33" />Lakini pabamwisili Yesu, baamweni panga ayomokile, kwa nyo baanti'kwaniyeli magu'lu'. <verse eid="JHN 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34" />Lakini asikali yumo aamwomite nkwa mumbau, popopo yapitike myai na masi'. <verse eid="JHN 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35" />Ywaalibweni likowe lyo aatikong'ondelya na ukong'ondeli wo wa kakape. Na atangite panga alongela ga kakape li'nga mwenga muu'bi'li. <verse eid="JHN 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36" />Likowe lyo lyaapangilwe kati mwagalongela Maandiko Mapeleteu, <char style="qt">“Ntu'pu' ata kyupa sake simo sasalu'a ti'kwanilwa.”</char> <verse eid="JHN 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37" />Kai' maandiko gi'ngi' gabaya, <char style="qt">“Baalu'a kunnola yu'lu' ywabaamwomite.” </char> <figure style="fig" alt="Water &amp; Blood - GT00102" file="Water&amp;Blood_John19.34_GT00102.jpg" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Gordon Thompson © Wycliffe Bible Translators Inc., 2012." ref="19:37" /><verse eid="JHN 19:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu endasikilwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat 27:57-61</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mal 15:42-47</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23:50-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38" />Bu'ka pa go, Yusupu, mwenekaya wa Alimataya, aannu'bike Pilato annyi'ki'ti'ye kuubu'ya ntwi wa Yesu. (Yusupu aai mumini wa Yesu, lakini kwa iyo, mwanjaa aayogopage api'ndo ba Ayahudi). Bai, Pilato ngaannyi'ki'ti'a. Kwa nyo Yusupu aayi'i kuubu'ya ntwi wa Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39" />Nikodemo ywaannyendeli patumbu Yesu lisu'ba limo kilo, aaisi apu'twile manemane yaiyangabanike na ubani kyasi sa kilo salasini. <verse eid="JHN 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40" />Bai, boti abi'li' ngabautola ntwi wa Yesu, na kuubilingya sanda yaipakalilwe na mauta manjuli bu'kana na Ayahudi mwabayobelile muusiki. <verse eid="JHN 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41" />Apo paabambilwe Yesu paai na kyati', na mukyati' so kwabile na lisiko lyalyabile linasikilwali mundu ywoywoti nkati yake. <verse eid="JHN 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42" />Kwa mwanjaa lyaai lisu'ba lyo bi'ka wiso Sabato kwa Ayahudi, na mwanjaa lisiko lyaai papipi, Yesu ngabansika mo. <figure style="fig" alt="Tomb being closed after Jesus burial - WA03928" file="TombBeingClosedAfterJesus'Burial_WA03928.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="19:42" /><verse eid="JHN 19:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20" />
  <para style="s">Lisiko lyabule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Peter &amp; John in tomb - CN01852" file="Peter&amp;JohnInTomb_CN01852.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="20:0" /> <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1" />Jumapili kindai' bulabula, Malia Makatalena aayi'i kulisiko, ngalibona li'lu' liwe lya paniango wa lisiko libu'yilwe. <verse eid="JHN 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2" />Bai, ngabutuka mpaka kwa Petili na kwa yu'lu' mwanamasi' ywi'ngi' ywaapendilwe na Yesu ngaabakia, “Bammu'yite Bwana kulisiko na tutangiteli kwabammi'kite.” <verse eid="JHN 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3" />Petili na yu'lu' mwanamasi' ywi'ngi' baayi'i kulisiko. <verse eid="JHN 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4" />Boti abi'li' baatibutuka lakini yu'lu' mwanamasi' ywi'ngi' aabutwike muno kuliko Petili, kwa nyo alongoli ika kulisiko. <verse eid="JHN 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5" />Paalitike no lingulya nkati, aibweni sanda, lakini aayingili nkati. <verse eid="JHN 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6" />Simoni Petili ngaisa nsu'gu' yake kanki'ngama, ngayingya mulisiko na amo aibweni sanda, <verse eid="JHN 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7" />na si'lu' kitambala saatabilwe Yesu muntwe. Saabi'kilweli pamope na yi'lu' sanda, ila saatikwi'kanilwa no bi'ki'lwa pandu pakisake. <verse eid="JHN 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8" />Bu'kapo yu'lu' mwanamasi' ywi'ngi' ywaalongoli ika kulisiko ngayingya nkati, ngabona, ngau'bi'lya. <verse eid="JHN 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9" />(Baai balo banagatangali Maandiko Mapeleteu gagaabaite panga yapalikwe ayu'ke bu'ka kwa awi'li.) <verse eid="JHN 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10" />Bai, abo banamasi' baabuyangani kaya.<verse eid="JHN 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ampitya Malia Makatalena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mat 28:9-10</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:9-11">Mal 16:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11" />Malia ayi'mi panja ya lisiko, kali'la. Paabile balo kali'la aatilita no lingulya mulisiko, <verse eid="JHN 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12" />ngaabona malaika abi'li' babaweti ngu'bo uu batami palu' pabaaugonjike ntwi wa Yesu, yumo kuntwe na ywenebi'li' kumagu'lu'. <verse eid="JHN 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13" />Abo malaika ngabannaluya, “Mau', kwa mwanjaa ki'li' muli'la?” Naywembe ngaabakia, “Baubu'yite ntwi wa Bwana wangu', na nitangiteli kwababi'kite!” <figure style="fig" alt="Mary Magdalene &amp; Jesus - CN01857" file="MaryMagdalene&amp;Jesus_John20.16-17_CN01857.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="20:13" /> <verse eid="JHN 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14" />Paalongelage go, aagalambuki nsu'gu', ngammona Yesu ayi'mi, lakini aakwipwili panga nga Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15" />Yesu ngaannaluya, “Mau', muli'la ki'li'? Mumpala nyai?” Malia akitage panga aywo ngannolekeyi wa kyati', ngammakia, “Bwana, manaitei wenga ngawaubu'yite ntwi wa Yesu, unibakiye kwaubi'kite, li'nga nikautole.” <verse eid="JHN 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16" />Yesu ngammakia, “Malia!” Naywembe Malia ngagalambuka, ngammakia kwa Kiebrania, “Raboni!” (Lombolya “Mwalimu”). <verse eid="JHN 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17" />Yesu ngammakia, “Upalikwali kunikamwa, kwa mwanjaa ninayendali kunani kwa Tati'. Lakini uyende kwa alongo bangu' ukaabakiye, ‘Niyenda kwa Tati' bangu' na Tati' binu, Nnu'ngu' wangu' na Nnu'ngu' winu.’” <verse eid="JHN 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18" />Malia Makatalena ngayenda kwapeya abali balu' banamasi' panga amweni Bwana, na aammakiye nyo.<verse eid="JHN 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu apitya banamasi' bake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat 28:16-20</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mal 16:14-18</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luk 24:36-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19" />Kitamwiyo lisu'ba lya Jumapili, banamasi' baakwembine munyumba, na milyango yaabile iyigalilwe kwa mwanjaa baayogopage api'ndo ba Ayahudi. Bai, Yesu ngaisa, ngayi'ma pakati yabe, ngaabakia, “Amani ibe kasinu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20" />Paayomwi longela go, ngaalaya moko na lubau lwake. Apo banamasi' ngabapulaika muno kummona Bwana. <verse eid="JHN 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21" />Yesu ngaabakia kai', “Amani ibe kasinu! Kati Tati' mwabanitumike nenga, nanenga nintuma mwenga.” <verse eid="JHN 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22" />Paayomwi longela go, ngaayulya na kwabakia, “Mupokyange Loo Mpeleteu. <verse eid="JHN 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23" />Mana mwaasamya bandu masambi gabe, basamilwa. Mana mwaasamyali, basamilwali.”</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 20:23">Yesu na Tomasi</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 20:23">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Thomas &amp; Jesus wounds in hands - WA03933" file="Thomas&amp;Jesus(WoundsInHands)_John20.28-29_WA03933.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Graham Wade © United Bible Societies, 1989, Nairobi, Kenya." ref="20:23" /> <verse eid="JHN 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24" />Tomasi (ywakemelwa Mapaga), yumo ywa balu' kumi' na abi'li', aabileli pamope nabo paaisi Yesu. <verse eid="JHN 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25" />Bai balu' banamasi' bi'ngi' ngabammakia, “Tumweni Bwana.” Tomasi ngaabakia, “Mana ngotwike kugabona mabai ga misumali mumoko gake no yi'ya lukonji lwangu' palu', kai' yi'ya luboko lwangu' mulubau lwake, katu, naau'bi'lyali.”<verse eid="JHN 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26" />Bai, bu'ka po pi'ta masu'ba manane abo banamasi' baabile kai' pamope mu'lu' nnyumba, na Tomasi aai pamope nabo. Milyango yaai iyigalilwe, lakini Yesu ngaisa, ngayi'ma pakati yabe, ngabaya, “Amani ibe kasinu!” <verse eid="JHN 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27" />Bu'kapo ngammakia Tomasi, “Ulete lukonji lwako pano, ugalole moko gangu'. Ulete luboko lwako ukaluyi'i mulubau lwangu'. Kaneube na kyukala, ila uu'bi'li!” <verse eid="JHN 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28" />Tomasi ngannyangwa, “Bwana wangu' na Nnu'ngu' wangu'!” <verse eid="JHN 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29" />Yesu ngammakia, “Buli, uu'bi'lya kwa mwanjaa unibweni? Nantali yabe balu' bangali kunibona, lakini bau'bi'lile.”<verse eid="JHN 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mabinio ga kitabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30" />Yesu aapangite kwa banamasi' bake myasu yambone, yi'ngi' iandikilweli mukitabu si'no. <verse eid="JHN 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31" />Lakini yi'no iandikilwe li'nga mupate u'bi'lya panga Yesu nga Kilisitu, Mwana wa Nnu'ngu', no kwo u'bi'lya mupate ba na ukoto kwa makakala ga lina lyake.<verse eid="JHN 20:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21" />
  <para style="s">Yesu apitya banamasi' saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1" />Bu'ka pa go, Yesu aatikwapitya kai' banamasi' bake mbwega ya litanda liku'lu' lya Tibelia. Aapiti nyinya. <verse eid="JHN 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2" />Simoni Petili, Tomasi (ywakemelwage Mapaga), Natanaeli mwenekaya wa Kana Galilaya, bana abi'li' ba Zebedayo na banamasi' bake bi'ngi' abi'li' baai pamope. <verse eid="JHN 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3" />Simoni Petili aatikwabakia, “Niyenda loba omba.” Nabembe ngabammakia, “Na twenga tulu'a longwana nawenga.” Bai, ngabayenda u'bu'ka ngalaba, lakini kilo so baapatikeli sosoti. <verse eid="JHN 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4" />Kakutumbwa saa, Yesu aayi'mi mbwega ya litanda liku'lu', lakini banamasi' baatangiteli panga aai nga ywembe. <verse eid="JHN 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5" />Bai, Yesu ngaalaluya, “Mwansembe, munapatali omba boboti au buli?” Bembe ngabannyangwa, “Ata! Tunapatali kili'be.” <verse eid="JHN 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Mutumbukiye lupi'li'li' lwingo lwa kummalyo ga ngalaba na mwenga mwapata omba.” Bai, ngabatumbukia no pata omba bambone, ata baakombwili uta kai' kwa nnyolokano wa omba. <figure style="fig" alt="Disciples hauling fish into boat - CN01875" file="DisciplesHaulingFishIntoBoat_CN01875.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="21:6" /><verse eid="JHN 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7" />Apo yu'lu' mwanamasi' ywaapendilwe na Yesu ngammakia Petili, “Nga Bwana!” Simoni Petili paayu'wine panga nga Bwana, ngawala kiwalo sake (mwanjaa aaweti ngu'bo ya lyengo bai), ngau'mbya mumasi'. <verse eid="JHN 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8" />Lakini balu' banamasi' bi'ngi' baaisi kumbwani kwa ngalaba ku'no kabauta lupi'li'li' lwalutwi'li omba, baabileli kuutalu na kuuyu'mu', ila baai meta mya bu'ka muntengo. <verse eid="JHN 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9" />Pabaaikite kuuyu'mu' baubweni mwoto wa makala ukunganilwe na panani yake paabi'kilwe omba na likati. <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus serving breakfast - LB00330" file="JesusServingBreakfast_John21.9_LB00330.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by Horace Knowles revised by Louise Bass © The British &amp; Foreign Bible Society, 1994." ref="21:9" /> <verse eid="JHN 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Muletange pano omba bi'ngi' ba balu' bamulobite.” <verse eid="JHN 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11" />Bai, Simoni Petili ngau'bu'ka mungalaba, aatiuta lu'lu' lupi'li'li' mpaka kuuyu'mu' lwalwabile lutwi'lile omba aku'lu' 153. Baatiyolokana, lakini lupi'li'li' lwakutwanikeli. <verse eid="JHN 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12" />Yesu ngaabakia, “Mwisange samulabuke.” Ntu'pu' ata yumo ywabe ywaalowite kunnaluya, “Wenga nga wanyai?” Mwanjaa baatangite aai Bwana. <verse eid="JHN 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13" />Yesu ngaisa, ngatola likati, ngaapeya, apangite nyinyonyo na balu' omba.<verse eid="JHN 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14" />Yi'no yaai pampanda patatu Yesu kwaapitya banamasi' bake tangu' yu'ka bu'ka kuuwi'li.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 21:14">Yesu na Petili</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 21:14">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Jesus talking to peter - CN01880" file="JesusTalkingToPeter_John21.15_CN01880.tif" size="col" copy="Illustrations by David C. Cook © David C. Cook Publishing Co., 1978." ref="21:14" /> <verse eid="JHN 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15" />Pabayomwi lya, Yesu ngannaluya Simoni Petili, “Simoni mwana wa Yoani! Buli, unipendile nenga kulikoni mwabanipenda ba?” Naywembe ngayangwa, “Elo Bwana, utangite panga nenga nikupendile.” Yesu ngammakia, “Wakote bana ngondolo bangu'.”<verse eid="JHN 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16" />Bu'kapo ngammakia pampanda pabi'li', “Simoni mwana wa Yoani! Buli, unipendile?” Petili ngannyangwa, “Elo, Bwana, utangite panga nikupendile.” Yesu ngammakia, “Wakote ngondolo bangu'.”<verse eid="JHN 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17" />Ngannaluya pampanda patatu, “Simoni mwana wa Yoani! Buli, unipendile?” Apo Petili aatiusunika kwa mwanjaa aalaluyilwe pampanda patatu, “Unipendile?” Ngammakia, “Bwana, wenga utangite goti, panga nenga nikupendile.” Yesu ngammakia, “Wakote ngondolo bangu'. <verse eid="JHN 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18" />Kakape nikubakia, pawaabile wamwinsembe wayobeli kwitaba lunga no yenda kwokwoti kwopala. Lakini pawapanga wang'oi wagoloya moko gako, na mundu ywi'ngi' aalu'a kutaba na kukupeleka kwangalikupenda yenda.” <verse eid="JHN 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19" />(Kwo longela nyo alayite Petili mwaalu'a waa na kunkwi'ya Nnu'ngu'.) Bu'kapo ngammakia, “Uniki'ngame.”<verse eid="JHN 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na yu'lu' mwanamasi' ywi'ngi'</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20" />Apo Petili ngagalambuka, ngammona yu'lu' mwanamasi' ywaapendilwe na Yesu kaki'ngama. (Ayu' mwanamasi' nga yu'lu' pakilyo sa kitamwiyo atamage papipi muno na Yesu na kunnaluya, “Bwana nga nyai ywaalu'a kusongya?”) <verse eid="JHN 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21" />Bai, Petili paamweni ywo, ngannaluya Yesu, “Bwana, na yu'no buli?” <verse eid="JHN 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22" />Yesu ngannyangwa, “Mana kanipala alame mpaka panaaki'li'bu'ka, wenga ga ki'li'? Wenga uniki'ngame nenga.” <verse eid="JHN 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23" />Bai, likowe lyo lyaabambite kwa balu' aumini panga mwanamasi' ywo aawali. Lakini Yesu ammakiyeli panga mwanamasi' ywo awaali, ila, “Manaitei kanipala alame mpaka panaaki'li'bu'ka, wenga ga ki'li'?”<verse eid="JHN 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24" />Ayu' nga yu'lu' mwanamasi' ywaagabweni makowe ga na kugaandika. Na twenga tutangite panga gaagalongei nga kakape.<verse eid="JHN 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuundi'la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25" />Kubile makowe gi'ngi' maingi gaapangite Yesu, ikapangage gaandikilwe goti, limo mpaka li'ngi', nengite ata dunia yene ilu'e li'nganali kwibi'ka itabu yaipalage andikilwa.<verse eid="JHN 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21" />
</usx>